    thinking: "**Assessing Available Skills**\n\nI\'m currently reviewing the user\'s request, examining all available skills to determine relevance. So far, the following have been eliminated as they don\'t appear to be pertinent: `applet-seo`, `cloudsql-*`, `figma-import`, and `firebase-integration-rpc`. I will continue this evaluation.\n\n\n**Identifying Relevant Skills**\n\nI\'ve determined that `focus-mode` is not applicable. However, `frontend-design` is relevant as it pertains to building an interactive application for PEI/PAEE/Estudo de Caso. Furthermore, `gemini-api` is pertinent because the user\'s action prompt and AI output suggest the use of Gemini for PEI generation, regulatory compliance, document creation, and integration with a progress tracking system.\n\n\n"
