    thinking: "**Defining the Framework**\n\nI\'m incredibly impressed by the depth of these resources and the regulatory landscape. The focus is coalescing around the **EduInclusiva PEI & PAEE 360\302\260** system - an integrated documentation system for AEE, Individualized Educational Planning, DUA 3.0, and a collaborative school dashboard. This framework is robust.\n\n\n**Validating the Compliance**\n\nI\'ve been meticulously validating the framework\'s compliance with key Brazilian educational policies and legal frameworks. I\'m focusing on aligning EduInclusiva with PNEEI, Portaria MEC n\302\272 421/2026, the Lei Brasileira de Inclus\303\243o, and relevant pedagogical guidelines like Cadernos Pedag\303\263gicos 3 and 4. The integration of NAPNE templates, with specific data fields, is also progressing.\n\n\n**Analyzing the Case Study**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into the multidimensional case study framework, broken down into its four stages as defined by the PNEEI. I\'m focusing on the first stage, identifying individual demands and barriers through observation and family interviews. Then I will be applying this framework to the PAEE, specifically looking at how the case study informs the creation of the individualized educational plan.\n\n\n**Developing the PEI**\n\nI\'m now deeply immersed in the nuances of the PEI (Individualized Educational Plan), meticulously aligning it with Portaria MEC 421/2026, Caderno 3, and the NAPNE template. The goal is a highly granular PEI, incorporating specific BNCC links (e.g., EF05MA09 in Mathematics) and adaptable SMART goals. I\'m focusing on DUA 3.0 implementation, classroom management strategies, and accessible formative assessment methods, including detailed support with the teaching staff.\n\n\n**Designing the Teacher Tools**\n\nI\'m now focusing on designing innovative teacher tools. I envision a \"PEI-Panel,\" a collaborative visual board with real-time updates accessible to the entire team, categorized into key areas like concepts, support, evaluation, and resources. I\'m also developing an interactive AAC board specific to the student, using text-to-speech and accessible selection. Additionally, I\'m integrating Gemini AI to generate new PEIs and enrich objectives with DUA strategies.\n\n\n"
