  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Addressing Image Quota**\n\nI\'ve hit a roadblock with the image generation quota, triggering the Zero-Broken-Image Policy. This means I need to re-evaluate the image request, as per the design document.\n\n\n**Defining Application Features**\n\nI\'m now focusing on defining the application\'s features to meet the user\'s needs, based on the provided case and directive. I\'ll ensure accessibility, using styled SVG/CSS fallbacks for images and integrating assistive technology. The application will center around the EST-GRR-05 case and include weekly support sessions for teachers, as well as ensure continuous student progress.\n\n\n**Expanding Student Case Support**\n\nI\'m now expanding the support for student cases. I\'m focused on allowing creation and switching between student profiles, including new PEIs generated via AI or custom forms. The goal is a highly flexible, adaptable system.\nI\'m ensuring the application supports diverse student needs as exemplified by the listed students.\n\n\n**Detailing Intervention Plans**\n\nI\'m now detailing intervention plans, focusing on PAEE and PEI/DUA 3.0. This involves mapping potential and support demands, and creating integrated plans for removing barriers, incorporating SRM, and weekly support sessions. It will involve intersectoral articulation and TA resources for the school. I will be incorporating PEI & DUA 3.0, mapping BNCC components, adapted goals, and DUA principles for multiple means of engagement and representation.\n\n\n**Developing Intervention Strategies**\n\nI\'m currently developing intervention strategies, including multiple means of action and expression like velcro cards, CAA boards, and tablet-based communication tools, and alternatives to manual writing. Classroom management will involve decompression breaks, wheelchair-accessible layouts, and early math sessions. Assessment will be inclusive and accessible with time extensions, peer support, and ongoing formative assessment. My focus is expanding on the PEI-Painel Colaborativo, a visual Kanban board for educators to share real-time updates on student progress, successful strategies, and necessary routine adjustments. I am creating an interactive CAA board as well.\n\n\n**Designing Functional Simulation**\n\nI\'m now designing the code structure for a functional low and high-tech communication board simulator. This will include math symbols, Gabriel\'s routines and preferences, and integrate a voice synthesizer. I\'m also preparing for official printing and export, ensuring the output matches the user\'s institutional document template and allows for PDF, JSON, and Markdown export. Furthermore, I\'m integrating an AI assistant powered by Gemini 3.8 Flash to generate and refine PEIs based on DUA 3.0 and Brazilian legislation.\n\n\n**Defining Data Structures**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the data structures. I\'ve started building the `/src/types/pei.ts` file for PEI, PAEE, Estudo de Caso, and related data. I\'m also working on `/src/data/initialCases.ts` with pre-populated cases for Gabriel, Rose, and Sofia, based on Caderno 3 & 4. Additionally, I\'m structuring the navbar, case overview, study view, PAEE, and PEI components.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_4777580"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"export interface CabecalhoPEI {\\n  estudante: string;\\n  codigo_matricula: string;\\n  idade: string;\\n  componente_curricular: string;\\n  modulo_periodo: string;\\n  data_elaboracao: string;\\n  docente_regente: string;\\n  docente_aee: string;\\n  profissional_apoio: string;\\n  coordenacao_napne: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface HistoricoNAPNE {\\n  breve_historico_clinico_familiar: string;\\n  descricao_condicao_especifica: string;\\n  informacoes_dos_pais: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface BarreiraItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  categoria: \'comunicacional\' | \'metodologica\' | \'tecnologica\' | \'arquitetonica\' | \'urbanistica\' | \'transporte\' | \'atitudinal\';\\n  descricao: string;\\n  impacto: string;\\n  estrategia_enfrentamento: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PotencialidadeItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  area: string;\\n  descricao: string;\\n  apoio_demandado: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface EstudoDeCaso {\\n  barreiras: BarreiraItem[];\\n  potencialidades: PotencialidadeItem[];\\n  recursos_ta: string[];\\n  sintese_observacao: {\\n    interacao_professores: string;\\n    interacao_colegas: string;\\n    tarefas_coletivas: string;\\n    interesses_centrais: string;\\n    alfabetizacao_e_matematica: string;\\n    cuidados_pessoais_autonomia: string;\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport interface MetaPEI {\\n  id_meta: string;\\n  descricao_meta: string;\\n  prazo: string;\\n  indicador_sucesso: string;\\n  progresso_percentual: number;\\n  status: \'nao_iniciada\' | \'em_andamento\' | \'alcancada\';\\n}\\n\\nexport interface DUAConfig {\\n  engajamento: string[];\\n  representacao: string[];\\n  acao_e_expressao: string[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface GestaoSalaDeAula {\\n  organizacao_espacial: string;\\n  rotina_e_pausas: string;\\n  agrupamentos_e_tutoria: string;\\n  suporte_docente_semanal: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface EstrategiasAvaliacao {\\n  formato_acessivel: string;\\n  criterio_de_sucesso: string;\\n  grau_mediacao: \'com_mediacao\' | \'sem_mediacao\' | \'pouca_mediacao\';\\n  tempo_e_espaco: string;\\n  recursos_utilizados: string[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PlanejamentoPEI {\\n  conteudo_ementa_oficial: string;\\n  competencias_habilidades_bncc: string;\\n  adaptacao_flexibilizacao_curricular: string;\\n  objetivos_e_metas: MetaPEI[];\\n  flexibilizacao_metodologica_dua: DUAConfig;\\n  gestao_sala_de_aula: GestaoSalaDeAula;\\n  estrategias_avaliacao: EstrategiasAvaliacao;\\n  observacoes_docente: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PlanoAEE {\\n  organizacao_srm: {\\n    frequencia: string;\\n    duracao_minutos: number;\\n    composicao: \'individual\' | \'coletivo\' | \'individual_coletivo\';\\n    espaco_atuacao: string;\\n  };\\n  materiais_a_produzir: string[];\\n  materiais_a_adquirir: string[];\\n  articulacao_ensino_comum: {\\n    objetivos: string;\\n    sessoes_suporte_semanal: string;\\n    profissionais_orientados: string[];\\n  };\\n  articulacao_intersetorial: {\\n    saude: string;\\n    assistencia_social: string;\\n    educacao_infraestrutura: string;\\n  };\\n  cronograma_revisao: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PostItPainel {\\n  id: string;\\n  autor: string;\\n  papel: \'Regente\' | \'AEE\' | \'Apoio\' | \'Coordena\303\247\303\243o\' | \'Fam\303\255lia\';\\n  categoria: \'objetivos\' | \'apoio\' | \'avaliacao\' | \'recursos_ta\' | \'rotina\';\\n  conteudo: string;\\n  data: string;\\n  cor: \'yellow\' | \'pink\' | \'blue\' | \'green\' | \'orange\';\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ItemCAA {\\n  id: string;\\n  rotulo: string;\\n  categoria: \'matematica\' | \'comunicacao\' | \'futebol\' | \'rotina\' | \'socioemocional\';\\n  icone: string;\\n  audioTexto: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PEICompleto {\\n  id: string;\\n  cabecalho: CabecalhoPEI;\\n  historico_napne: HistoricoNAPNE;\\n  estudo_de_caso: EstudoDeCaso;\\n  plano_aee: PlanoAEE;\\n  planejamento_pei: PlanejamentoPEI;\\n  painel_notas: PostItPainel[];\\n  metricas: {\\n    percentual_metas_alcancadas: number;\\n    nivel_autonomia: number; // 1 a 5\\n    engajamento: number; // 1 a 5\\n    sessoes_semanais_realizadas: number;\\n    status_geral: \'EM_ANDAMENTO\' | \'CONCLUIDO\' | \'REVISAO_NECESSARIA\';\\n  };\\n  parecer_pedagogico: string;\\n  sugestoes_proximo_ciclo: string[];\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Define TypeScript interfaces for PEI, PAEE, DUA 3.0 and Case Study system\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/types/pei.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating PEI types\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create PEI types\"}"
