  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing User Request**\n\nI\'m carefully dissecting the user\'s feedback. They\'re saying the application systematizes but fails to generate the PEI. Specifically, the generation process was slow or failing entirely, resulting in loading screens or fallbacks during generation, a major issue.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Core Features**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the user\'s core need: instant, reliable PEI generation with rich content. The UI will have a \"Cadastrar Novo Aluno\" area, enabling quick student additions with customizable details. The interface will prioritize PEI creation, removing CAA and PDDE sections and streamlining the application for PEI development, case studies, DUA methodology, and final document generation.\n\n\n**Integrating Practical Assistance Tools**\n\nI\'m focusing now on integrating practical assistance tools to improve documentation creation. I\'m building a \"Bank of Solutions\" with pedagogical accommodations tailored for different conditions, such as motor difficulties, visual impairments, and sensory overload, and difficulties in specific IT areas, like programming and databases. The aim is to offer instant, actionable solutions directly within the documentation process.\n\n\n**Developing Practical Solutions**\n\nI\'m now pivoting toward practical solutions, adapting agile methodology for iterative development with small sprints and visual diagrams. My focus is a guided step-by-step assistant for PEI completion, enabling users to insert recommended solutions with one click for any field, from curriculum to assessment. I\'m also developing an intelligent generator to produce comprehensive, detailed PEIs using the NAPNE template, and I\'ll include a dynamic editor for all PEI fields.\n\n\n**Refining Navigation & Features**\n\nI\'m now streamlining the application\'s core functionality. I\'m removing the CAA and PDDE sections and focusing the navigation on the PEI generator, a guided filling assistant, lesson plans, case studies, and the official NAPNE document. I also plan to add a \"+ Cadastrar Novo Aluno\" button for quick student registration, to ensure the new student form reflects the same requirements for document updates. I\'m also ensuring all changes are saved locally and reflected instantly in the official document, ready for printing.\n\n\n**Updating Code & Structure**\n\nI\'m now diving into the code, making targeted updates. I\'m focusing on ensuring clean types in `src/types/pei.ts` without CAA/PDDE. I am also making sure the initial cases in `src/data/initialCases.ts` are streamlined for Ensino M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico and Ensino Superior TI, enriched with solution bank data. I am also working on streamlining the Navbar, StudentHeader, AddStudentModal, SolutionBankModal, PeiView, and OfficialTemplateView components. Specifically, I\'m integrating a solution bank modal with technical conditions and a button to apply solutions directly to the student\'s PEI.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_2028643"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"export interface CabecalhoPEI {\\n  estudante: string;\\n  codigo_matricula: string;\\n  idade: string;\\n  curso: string;\\n  componente_curricular: string;\\n  modulo_periodo: string;\\n  data_elaboracao: string;\\n  docente_regente: string;\\n  docente_aee: string;\\n  profissional_apoio: string;\\n  coordenacao_napne: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface HistoricoNAPNE {\\n  breve_historico_clinico_familiar: string;\\n  descricao_condicao_especifica: string;\\n  informacoes_dos_pais: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface BarreiraItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  categoria: \'metodologica\' | \'tecnologica\' | \'comunicacional\' | \'atitudinal\' | \'arquitetonica\';\\n  descricao: string;\\n  impacto: string;\\n  estrategia_enfrentamento: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PotencialidadeItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  area: string;\\n  descricao: string;\\n  apoio_demandado: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface EstudoDeCaso {\\n  barreiras: BarreiraItem[];\\n  potencialidades: PotencialidadeItem[];\\n  recursos_ta: string[];\\n  sintese_observacao: {\\n    interacao_professores: string;\\n    interacao_colegas: string;\\n    tarefas_coletivas: string;\\n    interesses_centrais: string;\\n    habilidades_tecnicas: string;\\n    autonomia_rotina: string;\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport interface MetaPEI {\\n  id_meta: string;\\n  descricao_meta: string;\\n  prazo: string;\\n  indicador_sucesso: string;\\n  progresso_percentual: number;\\n  status: \'nao_iniciada\' | \'em_andamento\' | \'alcancada\';\\n}\\n\\nexport interface DUAConfig {\\n  engajamento: string[];\\n  representacao: string[];\\n  acao_e_expressao: string[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface GestaoSalaDeAula {\\n  organizacao_espacial: string;\\n  rotina_e_pausas: string;\\n  agrupamentos_e_tutoria: string;\\n  suporte_docente_semanal: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface EstrategiasAvaliacao {\\n  formato_acessivel: string;\\n  criterio_de_sucesso: string;\\n  grau_mediacao: \'com_mediacao\' | \'sem_mediacao\' | \'pouca_mediacao\';\\n  tempo_e_espaco: string;\\n  recursos_utilizados: string[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PlanejamentoPEI {\\n  conteudo_ementa_oficial: string;\\n  competencias_habilidades_ementa: string;\\n  adaptacao_flexibilizacao_curricular: string;\\n  objetivos_e_metas: MetaPEI[];\\n  flexibilizacao_metodologica_dua: DUAConfig;\\n  gestao_sala_de_aula: GestaoSalaDeAula;\\n  estrategias_avaliacao: EstrategiasAvaliacao;\\n  observacoes_docente: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PostItPainel {\\n  id: string;\\n  autor: string;\\n  papel: \'Regente\' | \'AEE\' | \'Apoio\' | \'Coordena\303\247\303\243o\' | \'Estudante\';\\n  categoria: \'objetivos\' | \'apoio\' | \'avaliacao\' | \'recursos_ta\' | \'rotina\';\\n  conteudo: string;\\n  data: string;\\n  cor: \'yellow\' | \'pink\' | \'blue\' | \'green\' | \'orange\';\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PEICompleto {\\n  id: string;\\n  cabecalho: CabecalhoPEI;\\n  historico_napne: HistoricoNAPNE;\\n  estudo_de_caso: EstudoDeCaso;\\n  planejamento_pei: PlanejamentoPEI;\\n  painel_notas: PostItPainel[];\\n  metricas: {\\n    percentual_metas_alcancadas: number;\\n    nivel_autonomia: number;\\n    engajamento: number;\\n    sessoes_semanais_realizadas: number;\\n    status_geral: \'EM_ANDAMENTO\' | \'CONCLUIDO\' | \'REVISAO_NECESSARIA\';\\n  };\\n  parecer_pedagogico: string;\\n  sugestoes_proximo_ciclo: string[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface SolucaoCondicao {\\n  id: string;\\n  titulo: string;\\n  condicao: string;\\n  nivelSugerido: \'M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico\' | \'Superior TI\' | \'Ambos\';\\n  descricaoProblema: string;\\n  remediosSugeridos: {\\n    engajamento: string;\\n    representacao: string;\\n    acaoExpressao: string;\\n    recursosTA: string[];\\n    avaliacaoAcessivel: string;\\n  };\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Update PEI types focusing purely on PEI, NAPNE documentation, and pedagogical solution bank without CAA/PDDE\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/types/pei.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating types\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update PEI types\"}"
