  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Drafting Solutions Now**\n\nI\'m now drafting new cases and their corresponding solutions. I\'m focusing specifically on addressing the statistics for NAPNE Campus Para\303\255so. The key data points are: 29 students in total, with 15 in Ensino M\303\251dio and 14 in Ensino Superior. I\'m also considering the 2 confirmed diagnoses.\n\n\n**Developing Student Cases**\n\nI\'m developing two student cases to illustrate NAPNE Campus Para\303\255so\'s approach. First, I\'m detailing the *Caso Larissa Menezes Costa*, a student with confirmed ADHD and High Abilities, focusing on the need for curriculum enrichment and executive function support. Second, I\'m drafting *Caso Cau\303\243 Ribeiro de Almeida*, who is in the process of diagnosis, as I try to address the remaining four students.\n\n\n**Formulating the Pedagogical Pivot**\n\nI\'m structuring a significant pedagogical case around the five students lacking confirmed diagnoses at Campus Para\303\255so. This case, featuring a student suspected of Developmental Dyslexia and Auditory Processing Disorder, is intended to be a pedagogical landmark. It will be directly anchored in Portaria MEC n\302\272 421/2026, highlighting the right to accessibility, Assistive Technology, and methodological flexibility via DUA 3.0, regardless of a definitive medical diagnosis. I\'m also including a new solution: \"Protocolo de Atendimento a Estudantes sem Diagn\303\263stico Confirmado / Em Investiga\303\247\303\243o (Portaria MEC n\302\272 421/2026).\"\n\n\n**Defining New Solutions**\n\nI am now focusing on two new solutions: \"Dupla Excepcionalidade (TDAH + Altas Habilidades/Superdota\303\247\303\243o) em Computa\303\247\303\243o e Engenharia de Software\" and \"Dislexia do Desenvolvimento & Dificuldade de Processamento em Sintaxe de Programa\303\247\303\243o\". These address specific needs in TI, particularly for students with ADHD/AHSD and dyslexia, respectively. I am also considering a new component, a Campus Statistics Banner, to be included in `StudentHeader.tsx`. This banner will present the essential NAPNE Campus Para\303\255so data, using interactive filters.\n\n\n"
