    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. Task Overview\n- User Request: \"Adicione um seletor de perfil no modal de cria\303\247\303\243o (\'M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico em TI\' vs \'Superior em TI\') para que o agente Ioda utilize exemplos de casos reais adaptados para cada modalidade ao gerar o PEI.\"\n- Success Criteria:\n  - Add an explicit, prominent profile selector in the student creation modal (`AddStudentModal.tsx`): \'M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico em TI\' vs \'Superior em TI\'.\n  - When a profile is selected, the creation modal presents modal-specific real cases/presets (derived from Campus Para\303\255so: 15 alunos de M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico vs 14 alunos de Superior TI).\n  - The Ioda AI agent prompt & pedagogical synthesis engine (`server.ts` and `initialCases.ts` / `AddStudentModal.tsx`) must actively use real case benchmarks and specific vocational/higher education competencies depending on the selected modality:\n    - M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico em TI: Foco na forma\303\247\303\243o profissional t\303\251cnica articulada \303\240 BNCC (Programa\303\247\303\243o Web, Algoritmos, Redes, Hardware), elimina\303\247\303\243o de barreiras em laborat\303\263rios pr\303\241ticos, roteiros estruturados, dupla tutoria, DUA 3.0 e tempo estendido sem redu\303\247\303\243o curricular.\n    - Superior em TI: Foco em autonomia acad\303\252mica, abstra\303\247\303\243o l\303\263gica avan\303\247ada, engenharia de software, modelagem de banco de dados (SQL/DBML), arquitetura de software, micro-sprints \303\241geis (Kanban/GitHub Projects), enriquecimento curricular para dupla excepcionalidade e interfaces de terminal/CLI para acessibilidade severa.\n- Target Applet ID: `7bcae91a-0d28-47f6-9349-d58b019c1e94`\n- App URL: `https://ais-dev-krwzzynhegkqukx43cumqj-729395395096.us-west2.run.app`\n\n2. Progress\n- Completed:\n  - Campus Para\303\255so statistics integrated (`estatisticasCampusParaiso` in `src/data/initialCases.ts`): 29 total, 15 M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico, 14 Superior TI, 24 com diagn\303\263stico confirmado, 5 sem laudo (hip\303\263teses em investiga\303\247\303\243o).\n  - Types updated (`src/types/pei.ts`): `status_diagnostico` (\'confirmado\' | \'em_investigacao_hipotese\'), `categoria_neurodivergencia`, `cid_ou_hipotese`, `EstatisticasCampusParaiso`.\n  - 5 complete cases created: Lucas (M\303\251dio - Paralisia Cerebral/coordena\303\247\303\243o motora), Beatriz (Superior - Baixa Vis\303\243o/SQL), Matheus (M\303\251dio - TEA/sensorial em redes), Larissa (Superior - TDAH + Altas Habilidades/dupla excepcionalidade em Engenharia de Software), Cau\303\243 (M\303\251dio - Hip\303\263tese s/ laudo/dislexia em l\303\263gica conforme Portaria MEC n\302\272 421/2026).\n  - Solution bank updated with 8 comprehensive solutions covering all campus conditions.\n  - `CampusStatsModal.tsx` created and wired into `App.tsx` and `Navbar.tsx`.\n  - `StudentHeader.tsx` updated with campus statistics banner, quick filter (Todos, M\303\251dio, Superior, Com Laudo, Sem Laudo), and diagnostic badges.\n  - App verified and compiled successfully with `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` (tsc --noEmit).\n- In Progress:\n  - Refining `AddStudentModal.tsx` to make the \'M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico em TI\' vs \'Superior em TI\' profile selector the primary driver of modal state, surfacing real-case templates corresponding to each modality.\n  - Updating `server.ts` prompt and synthesis engine so that the Gemini API system prompt explicitly receives `perfilModalidade: \'medio_tecnico\' | \'superior_ti\'`, injects real reference cases for that profile, and tailors the generated PEI accordingly.\n\n3. Key Findings\n- In `server.ts`, the Gemini call currently takes `studentName, grade, course, subject, barriers, potentialities, assistiveTech, docenteRegente, docenteAee, age, statusDiagnostico, campus`.\n- Adding `perfilModalidade` (\'M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico em TI\' | \'Superior em TI\') to `server.ts` allows injecting modality-specific few-shot exemplars into the prompt (e.g., using Lucas/Matheus/Cau\303\243 as real references for M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico, and Beatriz/Larissa for Superior TI).\n- In `AddStudentModal.tsx`, the profile selector should immediately update default course, discipline, module, real case presets (filtered by modality), and display real case reference badges.\n\n4. Errors & Fixes\n- `QPS or BW/in or BW/out quota exceeded` occurred when issuing rapid sequential `view_file` calls to the internal control plane.\n  - Fix: Avoid redundant `view_file` calls when file contents were previously viewed or can be written in full via `write_to_file`.\n- `path file:///src/data/initialCases.ts does not exist` occurred transiently right after a container rebuild.\n  - Fix: Re-executed cleanly once dev server finished mounting.\n- Compilation verified with 0 errors via `compile_applet`.\n\n5. Active Context\n- Files modified in previous turns:\n  - `/src/types/pei.ts`\n  - `/src/data/initialCases.ts`\n  - `/src/components/CampusStatsModal.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/StudentHeader.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/Navbar.tsx`\n  - `/src/App.tsx`\n- Files to edit for the user request:\n  - `/src/components/AddStudentModal.tsx`: Enhance the profile switcher (\'M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico em TI\' vs \'Superior em TI\') to filter and showcase real campus case examples (e.g. \"Usar caso base: Lucas (Programa\303\247\303\243o Web)\", \"Usar caso base: Matheus (Redes)\", etc. for M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico; \"Usar caso base: Beatriz (Banco de Dados)\", \"Usar caso base: Larissa (Engenharia de Software)\", etc. for Superior TI), and pass `perfilModalidade` to the generator.\n  - `/server.ts`: Update `/api/gemini/generate-pei` to accept `perfilModalidade` (\'medio_tecnico\' | \'superior_ti\'), inject real case benchmarks into Gemini prompt and fallback synthesizer.\n\n6. Next Steps\n1. Edit `/server.ts`:\n   - Accept `perfilModalidade` in the request body.\n   - In `systemInstruction` / Gemini prompt: add explicit guidelines and few-shot real case context based on `perfilModalidade` (M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico: EPT articulada \303\240 BNCC, forma\303\247\303\243o t\303\251cnica profissional, pair programming, acessibilidade de IDE; Superior: Bacharelado/Tecnologia, racioc\303\255nio abstrato avan\303\247ado, projetos \303\241geis, enriquecimento curricular, dupla excepcionalidade, terminal/CLI).\n   - In `synthesizeIodaPei`: tailor the pedagogical synthesis with the chosen modality.\n2. Edit `/src/components/AddStudentModal.tsx`:\n   - Enhance the profile selector at Step 1: prominent, clear toggle between \'M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico em TI\' (15 estudantes) and \'Superior em TI\' (14 estudantes).\n   - Show a \"Casos Reais do Campus Para\303\255so para este Perfil\" selector that lets the teacher auto-fill with benchmarks from Lucas/Matheus/Cau\303\243 (for M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico) or Beatriz/Larissa (for Superior TI).\n   - Pass `perfilModalidade` to `/api/gemini/generate-pei` and `gerarNovoPeiCompleto`.\n3. Verify with `compile_applet` and `lint_applet`.\n4. Report a concise summary to the user.\n\n7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Retain the strict focus on PEI for computing/IT (no generic mock data, no CAA communication boards).\n- Adhere to Decreto n\302\272 12.686/2025 and Portaria MEC n\302\272 421/2026 (PEI without medical report requirement for students in investigation).\n- Keep UI clean, responsive, and Tailwind-styled without inline styles.\n</summary>"
