  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Focus for Usability**\n\nI\'m currently streamlining the design around DUA 3.0 principles, primarily focusing on minimizing cognitive overload. The core idea is to maintain a laser-sharp focus on the pedagogical action, making the layout as straightforward as possible. I\'m also exploring options for personalizing information display, allowing for user flexibility.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Accessibility Features**\n\nI\'m now integrating accessibility features to enhance usability, considering options like font size adjustments and contrast themes. I\'m thinking about dividing content into clean visual blocks to simplify the user\'s experience. This includes organizing fields in sequential stages, using clearly defined cards.\n\n\n"
