  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Typography Choices**\n\nI\'m currently focused on typography for the project\'s interface, and have settled on loading the Inter font family, identical to iLovePDF\'s. I\'ve also incorporated JetBrains Mono to keep the project clean.\n\n\n**Anonymizing Student Data**\n\nI\'ve just finished anonymizing the initial student data. Personal details have been replaced with institutional codes and sensitive narratives removed, while ensuring backward compatibility with exported variables. I\'ve also removed the student name buttons in the `AddStudentModal` component, and am now supplying clean, anonymous templates for adding new student cases.\n\n\n**Defining Project Requirements**\n\nI\'m now outlining the project\'s features. Specifically, I\'m working to include features like Pedagogical Investigation, Database & SQL, Software Engineering with Sprints, and Software Architecture with APIs. I will ensure no personal names or identifiable data will be used. I\'m building `src/components/ILovePeiHub.tsx`, a component styled after iLovePDF, including a greeting, subtitle, student selector, and filter pills, and the iconic card grid.\n\n\n**Developing New Project Features**\n\nI\'m now integrating several new project features. I\'m focusing on \"Novo PEI com Ioda AI\", a guided Individualized Education Plan creation with DUA 3.0. I\'m also including \"Plano de Ensino (PEI)\" for viewing adapted goals and lab management, and \"Estudo de Caso & Barreiras\" for mapping contextual barriers. In addition, I will create a model compliant with NAPNE/MEC standards, a \"Banco de Solu\303\247\303\265es DUA 3.0\" for methodological accommodations, and a \"Painel de Acompanhamento\" for progress tracking. Finally, I\'ll include campus statistics data.\n\n\n**Implementing Navbar & Styling**\n\nI\'m now implementing the redesigned navbar, mirroring iLovePDF\'s style with an \"I\360\237\222\232PEI\" logo and key navigation links. I\'m working on the avatar, print button, and accessibility toggle. I\'m also updating `StudentHeader.tsx` with anonymized student names and a clean aesthetic. Plus, I\'ll update `index.html` to load the `Inter` font, as well as the new icons.\n\n\n"
