  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Modal Logic**\n\nI\'ve made a significant breakthrough: in `AddStudentModal.tsx`, I\'m removing `handleLoadRealCaseBenchmark` entirely, along with a chunk of code from lines 110 to 204! This simplifies things considerably. Also, in the first step of the JSX, I\'m replacing the existing \"Casos Reais de Refer\303\252ncia\" box with a cleaner, anonymous selection method.\n\n\n**Designing the Hub Component**\n\nI\'m creating the `ILovePeiHub.tsx` component, inspired by iLovePDF. The top section will feature a greeting. Below that, I\'m designing a sleek, rounded student selector bar. The goal is a clean, user-friendly interface for managing the PEI. I am eliminating all privacy concerns.\n\n\n**Structuring the Hub Component**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the visual structure of the hub\'s student information display. Specifically, I\'m working on the design of the header, aiming for an elegant and informative presentation of the active student. I am also implementing a iLovePDF-style filter pill interface to allow efficient navigation of different PEI-related content types. This will enable streamlined browsing and filtering of PEI information by type.\n\n\n**Defining the Card Grid**\n\nI\'m translating the iLovePDF card design into a new grid. I\'m focusing on \"Novo PEI com Ioda AI,\" \"Plano de Ensino (PEI),\" \"Estudo de Caso Biopsicossocial,\" and \"Modelo Oficial NAPNE / MEC\" cards. Each will have an icon within a colored square (Emerald, Mint, Teal, and Dark Teal respectively), with the category, description, and action defined. My priority is to keep it clean and intuitive.\n\n\n**Expanding the Card Grid**\n\nI\'ve added three more cards to the grid within the hub component, defining each with its category, icon, color, description and action. I\'ve integrated \"Documento Oficial\", \"Banco de Solu\303\247\303\265es DUA 3.0\", and \"Painel de Acompanhamento\", to improve navigation within the hub. These additions are key to improving overall usability. My focus continues to be on a clean and intuitive presentation for each card.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_2054725"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { PEICompleto } from \'../types/pei\';\\nimport {\\n  Sparkles,\\n  FileText,\\n  Search,\\n  BookOpen,\\n  Wrench,\\n  LayoutDashboard,\\n  ShieldCheck,\\n  BarChart3,\\n  Printer,\\n  UserPlus,\\n  ChevronDown,\\n  ArrowRight,\\n  Sliders,\\n  CheckCircle,\\n  HelpCircle,\\n  Laptop,\\n  GraduationCap,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\ninterface ILovePeiHubProps {\\n  activePei: PEICompleto;\\n  allStudents: PEICompleto[];\\n  onSelectStudent: (student: PEICompleto) => void;\\n  onNavigate: (tabId: string) => void;\\n  onOpenAddStudent: () => void;\\n  onOpenSolutionBank: () => void;\\n  onOpenCampusStats: () => void;\\n  onPrint: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const ILovePeiHub: React.FC<ILovePeiHubProps> = ({\\n  activePei,\\n  allStudents,\\n  onSelectStudent,\\n  onNavigate,\\n  onOpenAddStudent,\\n  onOpenSolutionBank,\\n  onOpenCampusStats,\\n  onPrint,\\n}) => {\\n  const [activeCategory, setActiveCategory] = useState<string>(\'todas\');\\n  const [isStudentDropdownOpen, setIsStudentDropdownOpen] = useState<boolean>(false);\\n\\n  // Categories matching iLovePDF pill style\\n  const categories = [\\n    { id: \'todas\', label: \'Todas\' },\\n    { id: \'elaboracao\', label: \'Elabora\303\247\303\243o do PEI\' },\\n    { id: \'dua\', label: \'DUA 3.0 & Acessibilidade\' },\\n    { id: \'estudo_caso\', label: \'Estudo de Caso\' },\\n    { id: \'oficial\', label: \'Documento Oficial\' },\\n    { id: \'metas\', label: \'Acompanhamento & Metas\' },\\n  ];\\n\\n  // Tool cards list in iLovePDF layout\\n  const toolCards = [\\n    {\\n      id: \'novo_pei\',\\n      category: \'elaboracao\',\\n      title: \'Novo PEI com Ioda AI\',\\n      description: \'Elaborar um novo Plano de Ensino Individualizado via assistente por etapas com DUA 3.0.\',\\n      iconBg: \'bg-emerald-600 text-white\',\\n      badge: \'IA Integrada\',\\n      icon: Sparkles,\\n      action: onOpenAddStudent,\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'plano_pei\',\\n      category: \'elaboracao\',\\n      title: \'Plano de Ensino (PEI)\',\\n      description: \'Consultar flexibiliza\303\247\303\265es curriculares, metas de aprendizagem e estrat\303\251gias de laborat\303\263rio.\',\\n      iconBg: \'bg-emerald-700 text-white\',\\n      badge: null,\\n      icon: FileText,\\n      action: () => onNavigate(\'pei\'),\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'estudo_caso\',\\n      category: \'estudo_caso\',\\n      title: \'Estudo de Caso & Barreiras\',\\n      description: \'An\303\241lise biopsicossocial em 4 etapas: barreiras escolares, potencialidades e recursos de TA.\',\\n      iconBg: \'bg-teal-700 text-white\',\\n      badge: \'Art. 11 PNEEI\',\\n      icon: Search,\\n      action: () => onNavigate(\'estudo_caso\'),\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'modelo_oficial\',\\n      category: \'oficial\',\\n      title: \'Modelo Oficial NAPNE / MEC\',\\n      description: \'Documento formatado nos 8 blocos oficiais do IFTO para valida\303\247\303\243o e processo SEI.\',\\n      iconBg: \'bg-emerald-900 text-white\',\\n      badge: \'Oficial IFTO\',\\n      icon: BookOpen,\\n      action: () => onNavigate(\'documento_oficial\'),\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'banco_solucoes\',\\n      category: \'dua\',\\n      title: \'Banco de Solu\303\247\303\265es DUA 3.0\',\\n      description: \'Cat\303\241logo de tecnologias assistivas e solu\303\247\303\265es pedag\303\263gicas para laborat\303\263rios de TI.\',\\n      iconBg: \'bg-emerald-600 text-white\',\\n      badge: \'DUA 3.0\',\\n      icon: Wrench,\\n      action: onOpenSolutionBank,\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'painel_metas\',\\n      category: \'metas\',\\n      title: \'Painel de Acompanhamento\',\\n      description: \'Gerenciar ciclo de reavalia\303\247\303\243o cont\303\255nua, percentual de metas e notas em post-its da equipe.\',\\n      iconBg: \'bg-slate-900 text-white\',\\n      badge: null,\\n      icon: LayoutDashboard,\\n      action: () => onNavigate(\'painel\'),\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'portaria_mec_421\',\\n      category: \'dua\',\\n      title: \'Garantia Sem Laudo (MEC 421)\',\\n      description: \'Apoio pedag\303\263gico e Tecnologias Assistivas garantidos para alunos em investiga\303\247\303\243o sem laudo.\',\\n      iconBg: \'bg-amber-600 text-white\',\\n      badge: \'Portaria 421/2026\',\\n      icon: ShieldCheck,\\n      action: () => {\\n        // Find anonymous student with hypothesis or open solution\\n        const semLaudoStudent = allStudents.find(\\n          (s) => s.historico_napne.status_diagnostico === \'em_investigacao_hipotese\'\\n        );\\n        if (semLaudoStudent) {\\n          onSelectStudent(semLaudoStudent);\\n          onNavigate(\'pei\');\\n        } else {\\n          onOpenSolutionBank();\\n        }\\n      },\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'censo_campus\',\\n      category: \'metas\',\\n      title: \'Censo do Campus Para\303\255so\',\\n      description: \'Painel demogr\303\241fico dos 29 estudantes acompanhados: 15 M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico e 14 Superior em TI.\',\\n      iconBg: \'bg-teal-800 text-white\',\\n      badge: \'29 Alunos\',\\n      icon: BarChart3,\\n      action: onOpenCampusStats,\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'imprimir_exportar\',\\n      category: \'oficial\',\\n      title: \'Imprimir / Exportar PDF\',\\n      description: \'Gerar vers\303\243o para impress\303\243o oficial ou salvar em PDF para anexar ao prontu\303\241rio escolar.\',\\n      iconBg: \'bg-black text-white\',\\n      badge: \'PDF / Print\',\\n      icon: Printer,\\n      action: onPrint,\\n    },\\n  ];\\n\\n  // Filter tool cards based on active pill\\n  const filteredCards = toolCards.filter((card) => {\\n    if (activeCategory === \'todas\') return true;\\n    return card.category === activeCategory;\\n  });\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"space-y-8 animate-fadeIn\\\">\\n      {/* 1. HERO SECTION (iLovePDF visual style) */}\\n      <div className=\\\"text-center pt-3 pb-2 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4\\\">\\n        <h1 className=\\\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight\\\">\\n          Ol\303\241, Jean Carlo, vamos come\303\247ar\\n        </h1>\\n        <p className=\\\"mt-2.5 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 font-normal max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\\\">\\n          Plataforma Ioda \302\267 Ferramentas inteligentes para elabora\303\247\303\243o, flexibiliza\303\247\303\243o curricular (DUA 3.0) e acompanhamento do PEI no IFTO.\\n        </p>\\n\\n        {/* Active Student Selector Bar */}\\n        <div className=\\\"mt-5 max-w-2xl mx-auto\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-3 shadow-xs flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 text-left\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-800 font-bold shrink-0\\\">\\n                {activePei.cabecalho.curso.toLowerCase().includes(\'superior\') ? (\\n                  <GraduationCap className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-emerald-800\\\" />\\n                ) : (\\n                  <Laptop className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-emerald-800\\\" />\\n                )}\\n              </div>\\n              <div>\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-50 px-2 py-0.2 rounded border border-emerald-200\\\">\\n                    Estudante Ativo\\n                  </span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 truncate\\\">\\n                    {activePei.cabecalho.estudante}\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-mono mt-0.5 truncate\\\">\\n                  {activePei.cabecalho.componente_curricular} \302\267 {activePei.cabecalho.curso}\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Switch Student Dropdown and New Button */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 w-full sm:w-auto shrink-0 relative\\\">\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setIsStudentDropdownOpen(!isStudentDropdownOpen)}\\n                className=\\\"flex-1 sm:flex-none inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 rounded-xl transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n              >\\n                <span>Alternar ({allStudents.length})</span>\\n                <ChevronDown className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-500\\\" />\\n              </button>\\n\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={onOpenAddStudent}\\n                className=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-white bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-800 rounded-xl transition-colors cursor-pointer shadow-xs\\\"\\n              >\\n                <UserPlus className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-200\\\" />\\n                <span>+ Novo</span>\\n              </button>\\n\\n              {/* Student Dropdown Menu */}\\n              {isStudentDropdownOpen && (\\n                <div className=\\\"absolute right-0 top-full mt-2 w-72 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-xl border border-slate-200 z-50 p-1.5 max-h-60 overflow-y-auto\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-1\\\">\\n                    Selecionar Estudante do Campus:\\n                  </div>\\n                  {allStudents.map((s) => (\\n                    <button\\n                      key={s.id}\\n                      onClick={() => {\\n                        onSelectStudent(s);\\n                        setIsStudentDropdownOpen(false);\\n                      }}\\n                      className={`w-full text-left p-2 rounded-lg text-xs transition-colors flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer ${\\n                        s.id === activePei.id\\n                          ? \'bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-950 font-bold border border-emerald-200\'\\n                          : \'hover:bg-slate-50 text-slate-700\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      <div className=\\\"truncate\\\">\\n                        <div className=\\\"font-semibold truncate\\\">{s.cabecalho.estudante}</div>\\n                        <div className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono truncate\\\">\\n                          {s.cabecalho.componente_curricular}\\n                        </div>\\n                      </div>\\n                      {s.id === activePei.id && (\\n                        <CheckCircle className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-700 shrink-0 ml-1\\\" />\\n                      )}\\n                    </button>\\n                  ))}\\n                </div>\\n              )}\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* 2. PILL FILTER BAR (iLovePDF Style) */}\\n      <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-center flex-wrap gap-2 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4\\\">\\n        {categories.map((cat) => {\\n          const isActive = activeCategory === cat.id;\\n          return (\\n            <button\\n              key={cat.id}\\n              onClick={() => setActiveCategory(cat.id)}\\n              className={`px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold transition-all cursor-pointer ${\\n                isActive\\n                  ? \'bg-slate-900 text-white shadow-xs\'\\n                  : \'bg-white text-slate-700 border border-slate-300 hover:border-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-50\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              {cat.label}\\n            </button>\\n          );\\n        })}\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* 3. ICONIC iLovePDF CARD GRID */}\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5\\\">\\n          {filteredCards.map((card) => {\\n            const Icon = card.icon;\\n            return (\\n              <div\\n                key={card.id}\\n                onClick={card.action}\\n                className=\\\"group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 p-6 shadow-2xs hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[175px] relative overflow-hidden\\\"\\n              >\\n                <div>\\n                  {/* Top Row: Icon + Badge */}\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-start justify-between\\\">\\n                    <div\\n                      className={`w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs transition-transform group-hover:scale-105 ${card.iconBg}`}\\n                    >\\n                      <Icon className=\\\"w-6 h-6\\\" />\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    {card.badge && (\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-mono\\\">\\n                        {card.badge}\\n                      </span>\\n                    )}\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  {/* Title & Description */}\\n                  <h3 className=\\\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mt-4 group-hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors\\\">\\n                    {card.title}\\n                  </h3>\\n                  <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                    {card.description}\\n                  </p>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Bottom Action Hint */}\\n                <div className=\\\"mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-800 opacity-90 group-hover:opacity-100\\\">\\n                  <span>Acessar Ferramenta</span>\\n                  <ArrowRight className=\\\"w-4 h-4 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\\\" />\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            );\\n          })}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* 4. FOOTER INFORMATIONAL BANNER */}\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-4\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-emerald-50/70 border border-emerald-200 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-emerald-800 text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\\\">\\n              <ShieldCheck className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <h4 className=\\\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-emerald-950\\\">\\n                Garantia de Rigor e Sigilo Legal (LGPD & Portaria MEC n\302\272 421/2026)\\n              </h4>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-emerald-800 mt-0.5\\\">\\n                O PEI mant\303\251m 100% da compet\303\252ncia curricular da ementa oficial sem rebaixamento cognitivo. Prote\303\247\303\243o de dados assegurada.\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => onNavigate(\'documento_oficial\')}\\n            className=\\\"px-4 py-2 bg-emerald-800 hover:bg-emerald-900 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl transition-colors shrink-0 shadow-xs cursor-pointer\\\"\\n          >\\n            Ver Modelo Oficial IFTO\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create ILovePeiHub component matching iLovePDF structure and visual design\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/ILovePeiHub.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing ILovePeiHub.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create ILovePeiHub component\"}"
