  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 2
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. Task Overview\n- User Request:\n  1. \"primeiro remova caso de referencia, pois nele invade a privacidade dos outros alunos, ja que menciona nomes e codi\303\247oes do aluno\" -> Strict LGPD & Decreto n\302\272 12.686/2025 compliance: purge all real student names and personal conditions from reference cases and UI.\n  2. \"segundo quero que mude a fonte ao todo\" -> Switch global typography to a modern, clean geometric sans font matching iLovePDF (`Inter`).\n  3. \"quero que fa\303\247a o app parecido com o Ilove pdf seguindo a msm estrutura, parecido com essa que eu te mandei mas as cores pode ficar no verde e branco, ou preto e verde\" -> Refactor application layout and structure to match the attached screenshot of iLovePDF (`/public/assets/aistudio/image_d5c358d4.png`):\n     - Branding: `I\360\237\222\232PEI` / `i\360\237\222\232PEI` (in black & emerald green with heart/green brand mark).\n     - Hero Section: \"Ol\303\241, Jean Carlo, vamos come\303\247ar\" + subtitle.\n     - Student selector / active case banner.\n     - Pill Filter Bar: `[ Todas ]` `[ Elabora\303\247\303\243o do PEI ]` `[ DUA 3.0 & Acessibilidade ]` `[ Estudo de Caso ]` `[ Documento Oficial ]` `[ Acompanhamento & Metas ]`.\n     - Iconic iLovePDF tool cards grid with colored rounded-xl icon boxes, bold tool titles, and clean two-line descriptions in green/white/black palette.\n     - Seamless navigation between Hub and detailed views (`pei`, `estudo_caso`, `documento_oficial`, `painel`).\n- Target Applet ID: `7bcae91a-0d28-47f6-9349-d58b019c1e94`\n- Development App URL: `https://ais-dev-krwzzynhegkqukx43cumqj-729395395096.us-west2.run.app`\n\n2. Progress\n- Completed:\n  - Font updated in `/index.html` and `/src/index.css` to load and apply `Inter` (Google Fonts: `Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900`).\n  - Anonymized cases in `/src/data/initialCases.ts`:\n    - Student 1: `Estudante INF-01 (T\303\251cnico Integrado)`\n    - Student 2: `Estudante BSI-02 (Superior TI)`\n    - Student 3: `Estudante INF-03 (T\303\251cnico Integrado)`\n    - Student 4: `Estudante BSI-04 (Superior TI)`\n    - Student 5: `Estudante INF-05 (Hip\303\263tese s/ Laudo)`\n    - Removed all real names (`Lucas Ferreira de Lima`, `Beatriz Santos Rocha`, `Matheus Alencar`, `Larissa Menezes`, `Cau\303\243 Ribeiro`) and personal family stories, keeping strictly institutional, privacy-safe pedagogical data.\n  - In `/src/components/AddStudentModal.tsx`:\n    - Completely removed `handleLoadRealCaseBenchmark` and the named reference buttons (\"Caso Lucas\", \"Caso Matheus\", \"Caso Cau\303\243\", \"Caso Beatriz\", \"Caso Larissa\").\n    - Replaced with an explicit Privacy & LGPD compliance banner (Lei n\302\272 13.709/2018 & Decreto n\302\272 12.686/2025).\n  - Created `/src/components/ILovePeiHub.tsx`:\n    - Full iLovePDF-inspired dashboard.\n    - Hero greeting: \"Ol\303\241, Jean Carlo, vamos come\303\247ar\".\n    - Active student selector with quick switcher dropdown.\n    - Filter pills bar (`Todas`, `Elabora\303\247\303\243o do PEI`, `DUA 3.0 & Acessibilidade`, `Estudo de Caso`, `Documento Oficial`, `Acompanhamento & Metas`).\n    - 9 tool cards with colorful icon boxes in emerald, teal, green, amber, and black:\n      1. Novo PEI com Ioda AI (Sparkles)\n      2. Plano de Ensino PEI (FileText)\n      3. Estudo de Caso & Barreiras (Search)\n      4. Modelo Oficial NAPNE / MEC (BookOpen)\n      5. Banco de Solu\303\247\303\265es DUA 3.0 (Wrench)\n      6. Painel de Acompanhamento (LayoutDashboard)\n      7. Garantia Sem Laudo - MEC 421 (ShieldCheck)\n      8. Censo do Campus Para\303\255so (BarChart3)\n      9. Imprimir / Exportar PDF (Printer)\n- In Progress:\n  - Updating `/src/components/AddStudentModal.tsx` top imports to remove unused named case imports.\n  - Updating `/src/components/Navbar.tsx` to display the `i\360\237\222\232PEI` brand logo, clean navigation links, user profile avatar `JC` (\"Jean Carlo\"), and DUA accessibility toggles.\n  - Updating `/src/App.tsx` so the default view is `activeTab === \'hub\'` (rendering `ILovePeiHub`), while supporting smooth switching to detailed views with a breadcrumb \"\342\206\220 Voltar ao Hub de Ferramentas\" button.\n  - Updating `/src/components/StudentHeader.tsx` to remove any remaining hardcoded student names.\n\n3. Key Findings\n- User strictly prioritized student privacy (LGPD / Decreto n\302\272 12.686/2025, Art. 12, \302\2475\302\272). No personal names or clinical diagnostic details can appear as \"reference cases\" in creation modals or public lists. Institutional codes like `Estudante INF-01` must be used.\n- iLovePDF layout revolves around a clean header, warm greeting (\"Ol\303\241, Jean Carlo, vamos come\303\247ar\"), pill categories, and rounded cards with top-left square colored icons.\n- Colors must be centered in green and white, or black and green, giving an institutional yet clean, modern feel.\n\n4. Errors & Fixes\n- `MISSING_EXPORT: \"casoMatheusMedio\" is not exported`:\n  - Cause: Previously imported `casoMatheusMedio` instead of `casoMatheusRedes` and `casoSemLaudoHipotese` instead of `casoCauaSemLaudo`.\n  - Fix: Corrected variable names. With the new anonymization work, these references are completely removed from `AddStudentModal.tsx` in favor of anonymous institutional templates.\n- All previous changes passed `compile_applet` and `tsc --noEmit`.\n\n5. Active Context\n- Modified files:\n  - `/index.html` (Inter font loaded)\n  - `/src/index.css` (Inter font applied to body, letter-spacing set)\n  - `/src/data/initialCases.ts` (Students 1 to 5 anonymized)\n  - `/src/components/AddStudentModal.tsx` (Reference buttons removed)\n  - `/src/components/ILovePeiHub.tsx` (Created)\n- Pending edits:\n  - `/src/components/AddStudentModal.tsx` (clean up unused imports at top)\n  - `/src/components/Navbar.tsx` (brand `i\360\237\222\232PEI`, profile Jean Carlo)\n  - `/src/App.tsx` (integrate Hub as default view with back navigation)\n  - `/src/components/StudentHeader.tsx` (anonymize student header tags)\n\n6. Next Steps\n1. Edit `/src/components/AddStudentModal.tsx`:\n   - Remove unused imports `casoLucasTecnico, casoBeatrizSuperior, casoMatheusRedes, casoLarissaSuperior, casoCauaSemLaudo`.\n2. Edit `/src/components/Navbar.tsx`:\n   - Update logo to `i\360\237\222\232PEI` (or `I\360\237\222\232PEI`) in black and emerald green.\n   - Add \"Hub de Ferramentas\" link and user badge for Jean Carlo.\n3. Edit `/src/App.tsx`:\n   - Default `activeTab` to `\'hub\'`.\n   - Render `<ILovePeiHub>` when `activeTab === \'hub\'`.\n   - In detailed views (`pei`, `estudo_caso`, `documento_oficial`, `painel`), display a clean top navigation bar with `\342\206\220 Voltar ao Hub I\360\237\222\232PEI` so users can return to the card dashboard with one click.\n4. Verify `/src/components/StudentHeader.tsx` to ensure all badges use anonymized codes.\n5. Run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` to ensure clean build with 0 errors.\n\n7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Privacy First: Never expose real student names or personal health data in sample cases or modals.\n- Design: Match iLovePDF card and pill layout in green/white/black palette with Inter typography.\n- DUA 3.0: Preserve font scaling (`A / A+ / A++`) and contrast themes (`Padr\303\243o / Alto Contraste / Conforto`).\n</summary>"
