  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Extracting Student Names**\n\nI\'ve crafted a method to isolate the student\'s short name from the header. By checking for parentheses, I can split the string and extract the portion before the open parenthesis. Then I remove the word \"Estudante\" and any extra spaces. I can now efficiently get the short student name!\n\n\n"
