  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Unifying Navigation Elements**\n\nI\'m currently working on unifying the \"Censo,\" \"Banco DUA,\" and \"Legisla\303\247\303\243o\" sections into a single \"Suporte & Diretrizes\" dropdown menu. My focus is on replacing lines 154 to 176 within the code with the new component. This should simplify the navigation structure considerably and improve the user experience.\n\n\n**Refining Support Dropdown**\n\nI\'ve made progress refining the \"Suporte & Diretrizes\" dropdown. The visual design is coming together, and I am aiming for a clean and intuitive presentation for the user. I\'ve focused on integrating the new design elements that provide support for the existing information. The implementation includes considerations for mobile responsiveness.\n\n\n**Integrating Solution Bank**\n\nI\'ve integrated the \"Banco de Solu\303\247\303\265es DUA 3.0\" into the \"Suporte & Diretrizes\" section. I\'ve focused on ensuring a clear and concise presentation, with appropriate icons and descriptions. I\'m aiming for a straightforward user experience. I\'ve added a button that, when clicked, opens the solution bank. I\'m testing its functionality alongside the other navigation items.\n\n\n**Enhancing Visual Statistics**\n\nI\'m now incorporating visual enhancements for the statistical data. I\'m focusing on the \"Censo Inclusivo Campus Para\303\255so\" section, aiming to improve its presentation and readability. I\'m also working on using a bar chart for data representation in the component. I plan to use icons to represent data. The new component aims to make the data much easier to read.\n\n\n"
