  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Gemini Responses**\n\nI\'m currently focused on how the application handles 429 quota errors from the Gemini API. The code in `server.ts` checks for the API key, but I\'m digging into how it gracefully manages the situation when that key gets throttled. I\'ll probably look for a better strategy to communicate with the user.\n\n\n**Refining Gemini Interaction**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on Gemini API interaction, specifically the use of Google Search. I\'ve realized that including `googleSearch` can inflate quota consumption, and potentially introduce rate limiting issues. I\'m considering alternatives to optimize token usage and minimize the chance of hitting quota limits, and speed up the response. I\'m also devising a more user-friendly way to report 429 errors from the Gemini API.\n\n\n**Implementing Quota Backoff**\n\nI\'m now implementing a quota backoff strategy. The idea is to set a flag in `server.ts` upon receiving a 429 error from the Gemini API, preventing API calls for a fixed period (e.g., 5 minutes). During this cooldown, the system will immediately return a synthesized response instead. This will lead to zero latency for the user during backoff periods and prevent repeated 429 errors. I think it\'s brilliant!\n\n\n**Validating Synthesized PEI**\n\nI\'m verifying that the structure returned by `synthesizeIodaPei` is compatible with `AddStudentModal.tsx`, specifically lines 185-353. I\'m checking that the front-end correctly processes the `success`, `data`, and `isIodaEngine` fields and correctly displays the `notice`. I\'m also looking for any `console.warn` or `console.error` calls that might need attention. I am making sure the synthesized data matches expectations!\n\n\n**Constructing PEI Header**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the `cabecalho` object within the PEI synthesis. I\'m ensuring all required fields like `estudante`, `codigo_matricula`, `idade`, and others are populated correctly. Specifically, I\'m generating a `codigo_matricula` and using data from the user input. I\'m populating the `profissional_apoio` field based on `perfilModalidade`. I will ensure that the constructed header is accurate and complete.\n\n\n**Examining PEI Structure**\n\nI\'m now diving into the deeper structure of the PEI data. I\'m focusing on the `estudo_de_caso_sintese` and `planejamento_pedagogico_pei` sections. I am making sure the keys are named sensibly so that data from the modal will be correctly and easily read in `AddStudentModal.tsx`, as I prepare the final PEI object. I\'m checking to see how well all sections work together.\n\n\n**Verifying UI Navigation**\n\nI\'m now confirming the user is correctly routed to the new PEI view immediately after creation. I\'m also examining `AddStudentModal.tsx`, specifically lines 355-357, and I\'ll replace the `console.warn` with a `console.log` call there to prevent stderr output. I\'m also looking for any other logging errors.\nI\'m also reviewing `server.ts` lines 415-424, where I will replace `console.error` with a log message.\n\n\n**Evaluating Gemini Call Strategy**\n\nI\'m now focusing on how the quota backoff logic integrates with the Gemini API call itself. I\'ve examined the `server.ts` code, specifically the `isQuotaOnCooldown()` function, and how it handles the Gemini API interactions. I\'ve considered that, when on cooldown, it immediately uses the synthesizer and returns a synthesized PEI, to avoid rate limit issues. It seems simple and effective!\n\n\n**Refining Gemini Prompting**\n\nI\'ve just removed `googleSearch` from my Gemini prompts; it\'s unnecessary for PEI generation and needlessly consumes quota. My focus is now on refining the core prompt to ensure the Gemini API call generates the desired PEI structure efficiently and in a way that minimizes the chance of errors. I\'m also now handling Gemini API quota errors, with a specific backoff duration.\n\n\n**Inspecting Server Endpoints**\n\nI\'ve just finished a comprehensive review of `server.ts`. I confirmed that the `/api/gemini/generate-pei` endpoint is the only one in the file. Now I\'m shifting my focus to `AddStudentModal.tsx`, specifically lines 150-184. I\'m taking a close look at the timeout and fetch logic in `AddStudentModal.tsx`.\n\n\n**Analyzing UI Notifications**\n\nI\'m now examining how error and quota messages are surfaced in `AddStudentModal.tsx`, specifically lines 150-184. I\'m focusing on the fetch logic and making sure the user is clearly informed about any API issues, including quota limitations. I\'m also looking into how potential timeout issues are handled and communicated to the user for a smooth experience.\n\n\n**Implementing Ioda Engine Badges**\n\nI\'m implementing an Ioda badge or toast notification to clearly indicate when the Ioda Engine generates a PEI. I\'m focusing on lines 150-184 of `AddStudentModal.tsx`, paying attention to the timeout logic and how quota errors are handled, for an instant response when on quota backoff. I\'m also ensuring the correct messages are used in the generated PEI (`observacoes_docente` and `parecer_pedagogico`). I\'m now making sure the user has a smooth experience.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_3906448"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Add quota cooldown tracking, remove unnecessary search tool, and eliminate stderr console.warn/error on 429 quota exhaustion\", \"EndLine\":425, \"Instruction\":\"Handle Gemini quota errors gracefully without logging to stderr\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"// Track quota cooldown to prevent repeated 429 errors\\nlet quotaCooldownUntil = 0;\\n\\nfunction isQuotaOnCooldown(): boolean {\\n  return Date.now() < quotaCooldownUntil;\\n}\\n\\nfunction triggerQuotaCooldown(durationMs = 300000) {\\n  quotaCooldownUntil = Date.now() + durationMs;\\n}\\n\\n// API Route: Generate PEI with Ioda AI\\napp.post(\'/api/gemini/generate-pei\', async (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  res.setHeader(\'Content-Type\', \'application/json\');\\n\\n  try {\\n    const {\\n      studentName,\\n      grade,\\n      course,\\n      subject,\\n      barriers,\\n      potentialities,\\n      assistiveTech,\\n      perfilModalidade = \'medio_tecnico\',\\n      statusDiagnostico = \'confirmado\',\\n    } = req.body;\\n\\n    const isSuperior =\\n      perfilModalidade === \'superior_ti\' ||\\n      (course && course.toLowerCase().includes(\'superior\'));\\n\\n    // Check if API key is not configured or currently on quota cooldown\\n    if (!process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY || isQuotaOnCooldown()) {\\n      console.log(\'[Ioda Engine] Utilizando Motor Pedag\303\263gico Ioda DUA 3.0 com benchmark de TI.\');\\n      const synthesized = synthesizeIodaPei(req.body);\\n      return res.json({\\n        success: true,\\n        data: synthesized,\\n        isIodaEngine: true,\\n        notice: `PEI estruturado pelo Motor Pedag\303\263gico Ioda (DUA 3.0 \302\267 ${isSuperior ? \'Superior em TI\' : \'M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico em TI\'})`,\\n      });\\n    }\\n\\n    const modalityGuidelines = isSuperior\\n      ? `PERFIL SELECIONADO: ENSINO SUPERIOR EM TI (Bacharelado / Tecnologia em Sistemas de Informa\303\247\303\243o - 14 estudantes no Campus Para\303\255so).\\nCasos de Refer\303\252ncia Reais do Campus:\\n- Beatriz Sales Guimar\303\243es (Baixa Vis\303\243o Severa \302\267 Banco de Dados Relacional e SQL): uso de terminal CLI acess\303\255vel, scripts DDL e modelos relacionais em texto (DBML/YAML) sem depend\303\252ncia de diagramas visuais rasterizados, NVDA, tempo estendido (+50%).\\n- Larissa de Moura Toledo (TDAH + Altas Habilidades/Superdota\303\247\303\243o \302\267 Engenharia de Software): gest\303\243o \303\241gil via Kanban/GitHub Projects com micro-sprints, enriquecimento curricular avan\303\247ado, autonomia universit\303\241ria e rubricas anal\303\255ticas.\\nDiretrizes Pedag\303\263gicas para Superior em TI:\\n- Foco em autonomia acad\303\252mica, racioc\303\255nio l\303\263gico avan\303\247ado e arquitetura de software.\\n- Instrumentos de avalia\303\247\303\243o: entregas cont\303\255nuas em reposit\303\263rio Git, sustenta\303\247\303\243o oral das decis\303\265es arquiteturais e avalia\303\247\303\265es pr\303\241ticas baseadas em projetos com tempo estendido (+50%).`\\n      : `PERFIL SELECIONADO: ENSINO M\303\211DIO T\303\211CNICO INTEGRADO EM INFORM\303\201TICA (15 estudantes no Campus Para\303\255so).\\nCasos de Refer\303\252ncia Reais do Campus:\\n- Lucas Ferreira de Lima (Paralisia Cerebral / Coordena\303\247\303\243o Fina \302\267 Programa\303\247\303\243o Web e Algoritmos II): Pair Programming orientado (piloto/copiloto), VS Code com tema e atalhos ergon\303\264micos, tempo estendido (+50%) sem empobrecimento curricular.\\n- Matheus Albuquerque (TEA / Sensorial \302\267 Redes de Computadores e SO): abafador circum-aural no laborat\303\263rio de redes, rotina estruturada de comandos de terminal, instru\303\247\303\265es diretas sem duplo sentido.\\n- Cau\303\243 Ribeiro Fontes (Sem Laudo / Hip\303\263tese Diagn\303\263stica em Investiga\303\247\303\243o \302\267 L\303\263gica de Programa\303\247\303\243o): garantia legal da Portaria MEC n\302\272 421/2026, enunciados fracionados com casos de teste em tabelas (Input/Output).\\nDiretrizes Pedag\303\263gicas para M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico em TI:\\n- Forma\303\247\303\243o Profissional T\303\251cnica articulada \303\240 BNCC.\\n- Acomoda\303\247\303\265es de laborat\303\263rio de inform\303\241tica: duplas colaborativas, roteiros passo a passo em Markdown, acompanhamento de monitoria e garantia de perman\303\252ncia e \303\252xito.`;\\n\\n    const systemPrompt = `Voc\303\252 \303\251 o agente Ioda (Inclusion on Diversity Agent), especialista s\303\252nior em Educa\303\247\303\243o Especial Inclusiva do Brasil e NAPNE, focado em Tecnologia da Informa\303\247\303\243o (TI).\\nLegisla\303\247\303\243o e Refer\303\252ncias:\\n- Decreto n\302\272 12.686/2025 e Decreto n\302\272 12.773/2025 (PNEEI)\\n- Portaria MEC n\302\272 421/2026 (arts. 7\302\272, 10 e 11) - O PEI N\303\203O depende de laudo m\303\251dico pericial.\\n- DUA 3.0 (CAST 2024): Engajamento, Representa\303\247\303\243o, A\303\247\303\243o e Express\303\243o.\\n- Princ\303\255pio Inegoci\303\241vel: O curr\303\255culo de TI deve ser acess\303\255vel sem empobrecimento ou rebaixamento cognitivo.\\n\\n${modalityGuidelines}\\n\\nRetorne estritamente um JSON estruturado com:\\n{\\n  \\\"cabecalho\\\": { \\\"estudante\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"codigo_matricula\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"idade\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"curso\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"componente_curricular\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"modulo_periodo\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"docente_regente\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"docente_aee\\\": \\\"\\\" },\\n  \\\"historico_e_condicao_napne\\\": { \\\"breve_historico_clinico_familiar\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"descricao_condicao_especifica\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"informacoes_dos_pais\\\": \\\"\\\" },\\n  \\\"estudo_de_caso_sintese\\\": { \\\"barreiras_identificadas\\\": [], \\\"potencialidades_interesses\\\": [], \\\"recursos_tecnologia_assistiva\\\": [] },\\n  \\\"planejamento_pedagogico_pei\\\": {\\n    \\\"conteudo_ementa_oficial\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n    \\\"competencias_habilidades_ementa\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n    \\\"adaptacao_flexibilizacao_curricular\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n    \\\"objetivos_e_metas_adaptadas\\\": [{ \\\"id_meta\\\": \\\"M1\\\", \\\"descricao_meta\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"prazo\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"indicador_sucesso\\\": \\\"\\\" }],\\n    \\\"flexibilizacao_metodologica_dua\\\": { \\\"engajamento\\\": [], \\\"representacao\\\": [], \\\"acao_e_expressao\\\": [] },\\n    \\\"gestao_sala_de_aula\\\": [],\\n    \\\"estrategias_de_avaliacao\\\": { \\\"formato_acessivel\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"criterio_de_sucesso\\\": \\\"\\\" }\\n  },\\n  \\\"painel_de_acompanhamento\\\": { \\\"status_periodo\\\": \\\"EM_ANDAMENTO\\\", \\\"parecer_pedagogico\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"sugestoes_proximo_ciclo\\\": [] }\\n}`;\\n\\n    const userPrompt = `Gere o PEI completo pelo agente Ioda para o perfil ${isSuperior ? \'SUPERIOR EM TI\' : \'M\303\211DIO T\303\211CNICO EM INFORM\303\201TICA\'}:\\nAluno: ${studentName || \'Estudante\'}\\nN\303\255vel / Modalidade: ${isSuperior ? \'Ensino Superior em TI\' : \'Ensino M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico Integrado em Inform\303\241tica\'}\\nCurso: ${course || (isSuperior ? \'Bacharelado em Sistemas de Informa\303\247\303\243o\' : \'Curso T\303\251cnico Integrado ao Ensino M\303\251dio em Inform\303\241tica\')} (${grade || (isSuperior ? \'4\302\272 Semestre\' : \'2\302\272 Ano\')})\\nDisciplina de TI: ${subject || (isSuperior ? \'Banco de Dados Relacional e SQL\' : \'Programa\303\247\303\243o Web e Algoritmos\')}\\nSitua\303\247\303\243o Diagn\303\263stica: ${statusDiagnostico === \'em_investigacao_hipotese\' ? \'Sem Laudo / Hip\303\263tese em Investiga\303\247\303\243o (Portaria MEC n\302\272 421/2026)\' : \'Diagn\303\263stico Confirmado no NAPNE\'}\\nCondi\303\247\303\243o e Barreiras: ${barriers || \'Dificuldades no laborat\303\263rio de inform\303\241tica\'}\\nPotencialidades: ${potentialities || \'Racioc\303\255nio l\303\263gico e dedutivo para tecnologia\'}\\nRecursos de TA pr\303\251vios: ${assistiveTech || \'Softwares de acessibilidade e tempo ampliado (+50%)\'}`;\\n\\n    // Attempt Gemini call with quick timeout\\n    const controller = new AbortController();\\n    const timeoutId = setTimeout(() => controller.abort(), 8000);\\n\\n    try {\\n      const response = await ai.models.generateContent({\\n        model: \'gemini-3.8-flash\',\\n        contents: userPrompt,\\n        config: {\\n          systemInstruction: systemPrompt,\\n        },\\n      });\\n      clearTimeout(timeoutId);\\n\\n      const outputText = response.text || \'\';\\n      const groundingChunks = response.candidates?.[0]?.groundingMetadata?.groundingChunks || [];\\n\\n      // Extract JSON if wrapped in markdown blocks\\n      let jsonStr = outputText.trim();\\n      if (jsonStr.includes(\'```json\')) {\\n        jsonStr = jsonStr.split(\'```json\')[1].split(\'```\')[0].trim();\\n      } else if (jsonStr.includes(\'```\')) {\\n        jsonStr = jsonStr.split(\'```\')[1].split(\'```\')[0].trim();\\n      }\\n\\n      if (jsonStr.startsWith(\'{\')) {\\n        const parsed = JSON.parse(jsonStr);\\n        return res.json({\\n          success: true,\\n          data: parsed,\\n          groundingChunks,\\n          isAiGenerated: true,\\n        });\\n      } else {\\n        throw new Error(\'Retorno sem JSON\');\\n      }\\n    } catch (genError: any) {\\n      clearTimeout(timeoutId);\\n      const isQuotaError =\\n        genError?.status === 429 ||\\n        genError?.code === 429 ||\\n        `${genError?.message}`.includes(\'429\') ||\\n        `${genError?.message}`.includes(\'quota\') ||\\n        `${genError?.message}`.includes(\'RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED\');\\n\\n      if (isQuotaError) {\\n        triggerQuotaCooldown(300000); // 5 min cooldown on quota exhaustion\\n        console.log(\'[Ioda Pedagogical Engine] Cota de API de IA atingida. Ativando Motor Pedag\303\263gico Ioda DUA 3.0 com benchmark de TI.\');\\n      } else {\\n        console.log(\'[Ioda Pedagogical Engine] Ativando Motor Pedag\303\263gico Ioda para sintetizar o PEI com excel\303\252ncia curricular.\');\\n      }\\n\\n      const synthesized = synthesizeIodaPei(req.body);\\n      return res.json({\\n        success: true,\\n        data: synthesized,\\n        isIodaEngine: true,\\n        notice: `PEI estruturado pelo Motor Pedag\303\263gico Ioda (DUA 3.0 \302\267 ${isSuperior ? \'Superior em TI\' : \'M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico em TI\'})`,\\n      });\\n    }\\n  } catch (_error: any) {\\n    console.log(\'[Ioda Server] Requisi\303\247\303\243o tratada pelo motor pedag\303\263gico resiliente.\');\\n    const fallbackData = synthesizeIodaPei(req.body || {});\\n    return res.json({\\n      success: true,\\n      data: fallbackData,\\n      isIodaEngine: true,\\n      notice: \'Recupera\303\247\303\243o autom\303\241tica do PEI efetuada com sucesso.\',\\n    });\\n  }\\n});\", \"StartLine\":287, \"TargetContent\":\"// API Route: Generate PEI with Ioda AI\\napp.post(\'/api/gemini/generate-pei\', async (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  res.setHeader(\'Content-Type\', \'application/json\');\\n\\n  try {\\n    const {\\n      studentName,\\n      grade,\\n      course,\\n      subject,\\n      barriers,\\n      potentialities,\\n      assistiveTech,\\n      perfilModalidade = \'medio_tecnico\',\\n      statusDiagnostico = \'confirmado\',\\n    } = req.body;\\n\\n    const isSuperior =\\n      perfilModalidade === \'superior_ti\' ||\\n      (course && course.toLowerCase().includes(\'superior\'));\\n\\n    // Check if API key is configured\\n    if (!process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY) {\\n      const synthesized = synthesizeIodaPei(req.body);\\n      return res.json({ success: true, data: synthesized, isIodaEngine: true });\\n    }\\n\\n    const modalityGuidelines = isSuperior\\n      ? `PERFIL SELECIONADO: ENSINO SUPERIOR EM TI (Bacharelado / Tecnologia em Sistemas de Informa\303\247\303\243o - 14 estudantes no Campus Para\303\255so).\\nCasos de Refer\303\252ncia Reais do Campus:\\n- Beatriz Sales Guimar\303\243es (Baixa Vis\303\243o Severa \302\267 Banco de Dados Relacional e SQL): uso de terminal CLI acess\303\255vel, scripts DDL e modelos relacionais em texto (DBML/YAML) sem depend\303\252ncia de diagramas visuais rasterizados, NVDA, tempo estendido (+50%).\\n- Larissa de Moura Toledo (TDAH + Altas Habilidades/Superdota\303\247\303\243o \302\267 Engenharia de Software): gest\303\243o \303\241gil via Kanban/GitHub Projects com micro-sprints, enriquecimento curricular avan\303\247ado, autonomia universit\303\241ria e rubricas anal\303\255ticas.\\nDiretrizes Pedag\303\263gicas para Superior em TI:\\n- Foco em autonomia acad\303\252mica, racioc\303\255nio l\303\263gico avan\303\247ado e arquitetura de software.\\n- Instrumentos de avalia\303\247\303\243o: entregas cont\303\255nuas em reposit\303\263rio Git, sustenta\303\247\303\243o oral das decis\303\265es arquiteturais e avalia\303\247\303\265es pr\303\241ticas baseadas em projetos com tempo estendido (+50%).`\\n      : `PERFIL SELECIONADO: ENSINO M\303\211DIO T\303\211CNICO INTEGRADO EM INFORM\303\201TICA (15 estudantes no Campus Para\303\255so).\\nCasos de Refer\303\252ncia Reais do Campus:\\n- Lucas Ferreira de Lima (Paralisia Cerebral / Coordena\303\247\303\243o Fina \302\267 Programa\303\247\303\243o Web e Algoritmos II): Pair Programming orientado (piloto/copiloto), VS Code com tema e atalhos ergon\303\264micos, tempo estendido (+50%) sem empobrecimento curricular.\\n- Matheus Albuquerque (TEA / Sensorial \302\267 Redes de Computadores e SO): abafador circum-aural no laborat\303\263rio de redes, rotina estruturada de comandos de terminal, instru\303\247\303\265es diretas sem duplo sentido.\\n- Cau\303\243 Ribeiro Fontes (Sem Laudo / Hip\303\263tese Diagn\303\263stica em Investiga\303\247\303\243o \302\267 L\303\263gica de Programa\303\247\303\243o): garantia legal da Portaria MEC n\302\272 421/2026, enunciados fracionados com casos de teste em tabelas (Input/Output).\\nDiretrizes Pedag\303\263gicas para M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico em TI:\\n- Forma\303\247\303\243o Profissional T\303\251cnica articulada \303\240 BNCC.\\n- Acomoda\303\247\303\265es de laborat\303\263rio de inform\303\241tica: duplas colaborativas, roteiros passo a passo em Markdown, acompanhamento de monitoria e garantia de perman\303\252ncia e \303\252xito.`;\\n\\n    const systemPrompt = `Voc\303\252 \303\251 o agente Ioda (Inclusion on Diversity Agent), especialista s\303\252nior em Educa\303\247\303\243o Especial Inclusiva do Brasil e NAPNE, focado em Tecnologia da Informa\303\247\303\243o (TI).\\nLegisla\303\247\303\243o e Refer\303\252ncias:\\n- Decreto n\302\272 12.686/2025 e Decreto n\302\272 12.773/2025 (PNEEI)\\n- Portaria MEC n\302\272 421/2026 (arts. 7\302\272, 10 e 11) - O PEI N\303\203O depende de laudo m\303\251dico pericial.\\n- DUA 3.0 (CAST 2024): Engajamento, Representa\303\247\303\243o, A\303\247\303\243o e Express\303\243o.\\n- Princ\303\255pio Inegoci\303\241vel: O curr\303\255culo de TI deve ser acess\303\255vel sem empobrecimento ou rebaixamento cognitivo.\\n\\n${modalityGuidelines}\\n\\nRetorne estritamente um JSON estruturado com:\\n{\\n  \\\"cabecalho\\\": { \\\"estudante\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"codigo_matricula\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"idade\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"curso\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"componente_curricular\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"modulo_periodo\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"docente_regente\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"docente_aee\\\": \\\"\\\" },\\n  \\\"historico_e_condicao_napne\\\": { \\\"breve_historico_clinico_familiar\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"descricao_condicao_especifica\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"informacoes_dos_pais\\\": \\\"\\\" },\\n  \\\"estudo_de_caso_sintese\\\": { \\\"barreiras_identificadas\\\": [], \\\"potencialidades_interesses\\\": [], \\\"recursos_tecnologia_assistiva\\\": [] },\\n  \\\"planejamento_pedagogico_pei\\\": {\\n    \\\"conteudo_ementa_oficial\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n    \\\"competencias_habilidades_ementa\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n    \\\"adaptacao_flexibilizacao_curricular\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n    \\\"objetivos_e_metas_adaptadas\\\": [{ \\\"id_meta\\\": \\\"M1\\\", \\\"descricao_meta\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"prazo\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"indicador_sucesso\\\": \\\"\\\" }],\\n    \\\"flexibilizacao_metodologica_dua\\\": { \\\"engajamento\\\": [], \\\"representacao\\\": [], \\\"acao_e_expressao\\\": [] },\\n    \\\"gestao_sala_de_aula\\\": [],\\n    \\\"estrategias_de_avaliacao\\\": { \\\"formato_acessivel\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"criterio_de_sucesso\\\": \\\"\\\" }\\n  },\\n  \\\"painel_de_acompanhamento\\\": { \\\"status_periodo\\\": \\\"EM_ANDAMENTO\\\", \\\"parecer_pedagogico\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"sugestoes_proximo_ciclo\\\": [] }\\n}`;\\n\\n    const userPrompt = `Gere o PEI completo pelo agente Ioda para o perfil ${isSuperior ? \'SUPERIOR EM TI\' : \'M\303\211DIO T\303\211CNICO EM INFORM\303\201TICA\'}:\\nAluno: ${studentName || \'Estudante\'}\\nN\303\255vel / Modalidade: ${isSuperior ? \'Ensino Superior em TI\' : \'Ensino M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico Integrado em Inform\303\241tica\'}\\nCurso: ${course || (isSuperior ? \'Bacharelado em Sistemas de Informa\303\247\303\243o\' : \'Curso T\303\251cnico Integrado ao Ensino M\303\251dio em Inform\303\241tica\')} (${grade || (isSuperior ? \'4\302\272 Semestre\' : \'2\302\272 Ano\')})\\nDisciplina de TI: ${subject || (isSuperior ? \'Banco de Dados Relacional e SQL\' : \'Programa\303\247\303\243o Web e Algoritmos\')}\\nSitua\303\247\303\243o Diagn\303\263stica: ${statusDiagnostico === \'em_investigacao_hipotese\' ? \'Sem Laudo / Hip\303\263tese em Investiga\303\247\303\243o (Portaria MEC n\302\272 421/2026)\' : \'Diagn\303\263stico Confirmado no NAPNE\'}\\nCondi\303\247\303\243o e Barreiras: ${barriers || \'Dificuldades no laborat\303\263rio de inform\303\241tica\'}\\nPotencialidades: ${potentialities || \'Racioc\303\255nio l\303\263gico e dedutivo para tecnologia\'}\\nRecursos de TA pr\303\251vios: ${assistiveTech || \'Softwares de acessibilidade e tempo ampliado (+50%)\'}`;\\n\\n    // Attempt Gemini call with search grounding and quick timeout\\n    const controller = new AbortController();\\n    const timeoutId = setTimeout(() => controller.abort(), 10000);\\n\\n    try {\\n      const response = await ai.models.generateContent({\\n        model: \'gemini-3.8-flash\',\\n        contents: userPrompt,\\n        config: {\\n          systemInstruction: systemPrompt,\\n          tools: [{ googleSearch: {} }],\\n        },\\n      });\\n      clearTimeout(timeoutId);\\n\\n      const outputText = response.text || \'\';\\n      const groundingChunks = response.candidates?.[0]?.groundingMetadata?.groundingChunks || [];\\n\\n      // Extract JSON if wrapped in markdown blocks\\n      let jsonStr = outputText.trim();\\n      if (jsonStr.includes(\'```json\')) {\\n        jsonStr = jsonStr.split(\'```json\')[1].split(\'```\')[0].trim();\\n      } else if (jsonStr.includes(\'```\')) {\\n        jsonStr = jsonStr.split(\'```\')[1].split(\'```\')[0].trim();\\n      }\\n\\n      if (jsonStr.startsWith(\'{\')) {\\n        const parsed = JSON.parse(jsonStr);\\n        return res.json({\\n          success: true,\\n          data: parsed,\\n          groundingChunks,\\n          isAiGenerated: true,\\n        });\\n      } else {\\n        throw new Error(\'Retorno do Gemini n\303\243o continha bloco JSON v\303\241lido\');\\n      }\\n    } catch (genError: any) {\\n      clearTimeout(timeoutId);\\n      console.warn(\'Gemini API call timed out or hit quota; utilizing Ioda Pedagogical Engine:\', genError.message);\\n      const synthesized = synthesizeIodaPei(req.body);\\n      return res.json({\\n        success: true,\\n        data: synthesized,\\n        isIodaEngine: true,\\n        notice: `PEI gerado via Motor Pedag\303\263gico Ioda com benchmark para ${isSuperior ? \'Superior em TI\' : \'M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico em TI\'}`,\\n      });\\n    }\\n  } catch (error: any) {\\n    console.error(\'General error handling /api/gemini/generate-pei:\', error);\\n    const fallbackData = synthesizeIodaPei(req.body || {});\\n    return res.json({\\n      success: true,\\n      data: fallbackData,\\n      isIodaEngine: true,\\n      notice: \'Recupera\303\247\303\243o autom\303\241tica do PEI efetuada com sucesso.\',\\n    });\\n  }\\n});\", \"TargetFile\":\"/server.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating server.ts error handling\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update server.ts quota handling\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\255p\n\252p\001i\024}\023i\223\210g\b\220\306\2240\272\323\234\260\177hBe<\372\267|\366\367\276g\357\220Yfb\227\005\034\177\201c\300Q3\001\237\342\233\022\t#\330g\237\371-\337G\235\230a\335\3443*\367\261\377\376\a\n**\374\023\362VH)^\001\254+\260\273\222R0\026P\334\342\265\323\267o\241\2116\215m9\206\026e\202\367D\244\265\026\213:\335U\303I\177@ga\021}\024&^\035<L\244 \020\350:\347\225\000\304s\202\230\250\365\324i\033\264\b\356\303q\264\255\333\031\211\2049\251\001M\211\362\374\343\271S\347\364\275F\332\366\241\302\227\204_\027\376\265{\376v2/q\324P},y\270\213\224\213\026\351\310\226\322\245\360/:O\314\017~v/K^\177o\335\000\241H\333hI\232\256i\376\177z?\224\000\232\003Ga\034DM\004\3738R\302\202\220\331O\326\036UY\234\004\354\036<!\346\322iD\273\311\310\214\006>[au/\3426\241\3715W\262\311\t\304\233\312\331\232N\r\217\276\035\020\235G\247o\326\254A\026\277\230\305\226\257\031|J\261l;h\f\301\027\035Y\177\215\314\311\370\323Q\264Uj\206s\347/\344R\225\322\374MEc\342\361\250F\276[\362\003\345p\244Z\307F\vQ\021\304\237[\227S\335L\347\227`WW\265\202\322\366w-\020K\355\366\n\3760U3\367=\032\3664\327\373\376\025U\b\330?`nywI\261\343\336\204`\270r\255n\236\263r\'t\2357i\227E\033\241\264\201\300\364\373\236\241\365P\210\324\373g\232\264?\350\372\001\'\212\017r\327&E\363\342>\277\352\300\3278\205\306\302\267R\327\327\332\224\344\345f\277~\276]?82\b\230\354m\b\367\243\217f\023\022\343\340\226\222\374\2170U_\024\034=?f\244\321\305R\211<\374\304\374\273\022\016,\nh\036\226_+t\366\271Q\337\002\351\205*\271\000M6M:%\340\332\273\0244\036\237\230\0355\337`C#\322J\203\250\214\245p\016\021\230\274\266\234\357\272 \246\305\037\342\317\023w19I\023b@\327\203\037*k\t2\337%\244\332\307\256 \230q|\224rp\227\314\024\'A\352a\346c\005l\223\220\023\364\335\274t\0230\034\311\343\321\351*\247+@\232\373BC:\317t\024L?\240?\021\325\006\367tq\326a\203A(\314\241\337\323T\350\363\350-1\203\001\234\023\346\240\316).A\262\350n\223\363\321Vj\336\033r\356\254\314\324\'\236\240