  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Student Modal**\n\nI\'m currently working on refining the `AddStudentModal.tsx` component. I\'m focusing on how the profile and course selections will interact with the PPC and Plano de Ensino attachments. Specifically, I\'m considering the case where `superior_ti` is chosen, and how that influences course and module selection. For this profile, the course should automatically be set to `Bacharelado em Sistemas de Informa\303\247\303\243o (Campus Para\303\255so do Tocantins)`.\n\n\n**Adding Course Presets**\n\nI\'ve been thinking about enhancing the course selection process. I\'ve defined presets for courses and disciplines to streamline the user experience, including specific period and professor details. These presets cover subjects like Software Engineering II, Relational Databases, Algorithms, Computer Networks, and Web Programming, catering to various academic levels. Moreover, I\'m working to explicitly list neurodivergences in the third step, \"Barreiras & DUA\", which include conditions such as ADHD and Autism Spectrum Disorder.\n\n\n"
