  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Neurodivergence Checks**\n\nI\'m currently focused on enhancing `server.ts` to comprehensively identify all nine neurodivergences. Specifically, I\'m integrating checks for TDAH, TEA, anxiety, and learning differences. My approach is to leverage keywords and patterns in the input data to trigger these identifications.\n\n\n**Expanding Neurodivergence Spectrum**\n\nI\'ve broadened the scope to include additional neurodivergences. I\'m now incorporating checks for intellectual disabilities, OCD, mixed anxiety-depressive disorder, depression, and epilepsy using relevant keywords. Further, I\'m integrating specific checks within the academic context, aligning with course content and learning plans from `Engenharia de Software II` and other PPC subjects.\n\n\n"
