  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Updating Component Imports**\n\nI\'m currently updating `src/components/AddStudentModal.tsx`. I\'ve added the necessary icons: `Brain`, `HeartPulse`, `Activity`, `CheckSquare`, `ShieldAlert`, and `BookOpen` to the component\'s imports. I\'m now defining `NEURODIVERGENCIAS_OFICIAIS` with the nine official neurodiverg\303\252ncias, to be used elsewhere in the component.\n\n\n**Defining Neurodiverg\303\252ncias and Presets**\n\nI\'ve just defined `NEURODIVERGENCIAS_OFICIAIS` and filled it with the official neurodiverg\303\252ncias. I\'m also creating `PRESETS_DO_PPC_E_PLANO_DE_ENSINO` to hold various course presets, including \"Engenharia de Software II\" and \"Banco de Dados Relacional e SQL\", and others.\n\n\n**Implementing Quick-Select Presets**\n\nI\'m now focusing on Step 2 of the modal. I\'m building out the quick-select preset chips. My goal is to allow students to select courses and disciplines from the PPC and Plano de Ensino with just one click. This will streamline the initial input process significantly. I\'m aiming for a highly efficient and intuitive user experience.\n\n\n"
