  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Adding Preset Selector**\n\nI\'ve been working on integrating a preset selector for quick access, positioning it directly above Card B. This will allow the user to conveniently choose presets from the PPC and Plano de Ensino. It\'s a key part of the flow for ease of use.\n\n\n**Implementing Preset Functionality**\n\nI\'ve just added the ability to pre-populate form fields using preset selections. It works by having two data sources; the PPC and Plano de Ensino. These are now displayed as clickable buttons and, if selected, will instantly populate with one click.\n\n\n"
