  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Listing Neurodiverg\303\252ncias**\n\nI\'m now focused on incorporating a detailed list of the nine neurodiverg\303\252ncias. I\'m carefully replacing specific code lines (925-958) with the comprehensive listing, starting with `Transtorno do D\303\251ficit de Aten\303\247\303\243o com Hiperatividade (TDAH)` and `Transtorno do Espectro Autista`. I am meticulously ensuring the precise translation and formatting of each element, to guarantee both accuracy and clarity in the final implementation.\n\n\n**Expanding Neurodiverg\303\252ncias**\n\nI\'m now integrating more neurodiverg\303\252ncias into the list. I\'m adding `Transtornos de ansiedade`, `Transtorno espec\303\255fico de aprendizagem`, `Defici\303\252ncia intelectual`, `Transtorno obsessivo-compulsivo`, `Transtorno misto ansioso e depressivo`, `Transtornos depressivos`, and `Epilepsia e crises convulsivas`. I\'m meticulously updating the `lista9Neurodivergencias` array to accurately reflect each addition, including unique IDs, titles, acronyms, icons and short summaries for each entry.\n\n\n**Adding Anxiety Solutions**\n\nI am now focusing on solutions for anxiety. I\'ve added a section including a video presentation option or a reserved space for the user, early feedback, short breaks, and extra time (+50%). I\'m paying careful attention to ensuring the implementation is clear and user-friendly.\n\n\n\n**Adding More Solutions**\n\nI\'m now integrating solutions for more conditions. I\'ve included strategies for `Transtorno misto ansioso e depressivo`, detailing goal pacts and weekly deliverables, and also for `Transtornos depressivos`, focusing on accompanied activities and Moodle access. Additionally, I added solutions for `Epilepsia e crises convulsivas`, including stable monitor rates and safety protocols. I\'m carefully considering how to make the integration seamless, adding a button for \"Outras Condi\303\247\303\265es,\" including `Defici\303\252ncia Visual`, `Defici\303\252ncia F\303\255sica`, and `Surdez`. I\'m working to expand the information that the user will be able to control through this toggle.\n\n\n"
