  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Updating the Code**\n\nI\'m currently focused on refactoring `AddStudentModal.tsx`, specifically lines 798-960. My primary goal is to integrate the Quick Presets box for PPC and Plano de Ensino. I\'m also preparing to add the interactive list of the nine neurodiverg\303\252ncias, starting with Transtorno do D\303\251ficit de Aten\303\247\303\243o.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_2591979"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Render PPC/Plano de Ensino presets in Step 2 and the 9 specific Neurodivergences in Step 3 of AddStudentModal.tsx\", \"EndLine\":958, \"Instruction\":\"Add course presets from PPC and Plano de Ensino in Step 2, and list the 9 neurodivergences in Step 3\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"              {/* Card B: Componente Curricular de TI */}\\n              <div className=\\\"p-3.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl space-y-3\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                  <h4 className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                    <Laptop className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-700\\\" />\\n                    <span>Componente Curricular & Curso de TI:</span>\\n                  </h4>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-emerald-200 font-mono\\\">\\n                    PPC BSI & Plano de Ensino IFTO\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Quick Presets from PPC do BSI and Plano de Ensino in attachment */}\\n                <div className=\\\"p-2.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg space-y-1.5\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-700 block\\\">\\n                    Sugest\303\265es R\303\241pidas de Disciplinas do Campus Para\303\255so (PPC / Anexo):\\n                  </span>\\n                  <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-1.5\\\">\\n                    {presetsPpcEPlano.map((p) => {\\n                      const isCurrent = disciplina === p.titulo;\\n                      return (\\n                        <button\\n                          key={p.id}\\n                          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                          onClick={() => handleApplyCoursePreset(p)}\\n                          className={`p-2 rounded-lg border text-left transition-all cursor-pointer ${\\n                            isCurrent\\n                              ? \'bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-600 shadow-xs ring-1 ring-emerald-600\'\\n                              : \'bg-slate-50/70 border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-300 hover:bg-white\'\\n                          }`}\\n                        >\\n                          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                            <span className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 truncate\\\">{p.titulo}</span>\\n                            <span className=\\\"text-[9px] px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded font-mono font-medium bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-900 shrink-0 ml-1\\\">\\n                              {p.tag}\\n                            </span>\\n                          </div>\\n                          <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 block truncate mt-0.5\\\">\\n                            {p.docente} \302\267 {p.modulo}\\n                          </span>\\n                        </button>\\n                      );\\n                    })}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"sm:col-span-2\\\">\\n                    <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\\\">\\n                      Curso de TI <span className=\\\"text-red-500\\\">*</span>\\n                    </label>\\n                    <input\\n                      type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                      value={curso}\\n                      onChange={(e) => setCurso(e.target.value)}\\n                      className=\\\"w-full p-2.5 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-600 focus:outline-none bg-white text-xs\\\"\\n                      required\\n                    />\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div>\\n                    <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\\\">\\n                      M\303\263dulo / Per\303\255odo / Ano\\n                    </label>\\n                    <input\\n                      type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                      value={modulo}\\n                      onChange={(e) => setModulo(e.target.value)}\\n                      className=\\\"w-full p-2.5 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-600 focus:outline-none bg-white text-xs\\\"\\n                      required\\n                    />\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div>\\n                  <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\\\">\\n                    Disciplina / Componente Curricular de Computa\303\247\303\243o <span className=\\\"text-red-500\\\">*</span>\\n                  </label>\\n                  <input\\n                    type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                    value={disciplina}\\n                    onChange={(e) => setDisciplina(e.target.value)}\\n                    placeholder=\\\"Ex: BAC.0406 - Engenharia de Software II\\\"\\n                    className=\\\"w-full p-2.5 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-600 focus:outline-none bg-white text-xs font-medium\\\"\\n                    required\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Card C: Doc\303\252ncia e AEE */}\\n              <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"p-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl\\\">\\n                  <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\\\">\\n                    Docente Regente da Disciplina\\n                  </label>\\n                  <input\\n                    type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                    value={docenteRegente}\\n                    onChange={(e) => setDocenteRegente(e.target.value)}\\n                    className=\\\"w-full p-2.5 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-600 focus:outline-none bg-white text-xs\\\"\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"p-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl\\\">\\n                  <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\\\">\\n                    Coordena\303\247\303\243o NAPNE (Campus Para\303\255so)\\n                  </label>\\n                  <input\\n                    type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                    value={docenteAee}\\n                    disabled\\n                    className=\\\"w-full p-2.5 border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 rounded-lg text-xs\\\"\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n\\n          {/* ============================================================== */}\\n          {/* ETAPA 3: ESTUDO DE CASO, BARREIRAS & DUA 3.0                   */}\\n          {/* ============================================================== */}\\n          {currentStep === 3 && (\\n            <div className=\\\"space-y-4 animate-fadeIn\\\">\\n              {/* Contexto do Curso e da Disciplina */}\\n              <div className=\\\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/70 border border-emerald-200 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-between text-xs\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                  <Laptop className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-800 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                  <div>\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-slate-600\\\">Planejamento para: </span>\\n                    <strong className=\\\"text-emerald-950\\\">{disciplina}</strong>\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-slate-500 text-[11px] block\\\">{curso} ({modulo})</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono bg-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-emerald-200 text-emerald-900 font-semibold\\\">\\n                  {perfilModalidade === \'superior_ti\' ? \'Superior BSI\' : \'M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico\'}\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Situa\303\247\303\243o Diagn\303\263stica (Portaria MEC n\302\272 421/2026) */}\\n              <div className=\\\"p-3.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl space-y-2\\\">\\n                <label className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-wider block\\\">\\n                  Situa\303\247\303\243o Diagn\303\263stica (Portaria MEC n\302\272 421/2026):\\n                </label>\\n                <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\\\">\\n                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => setStatusDiagnostico(\'confirmado\')}\\n                    className={`p-2.5 rounded-lg border text-xs font-semibold text-center transition-all cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 ${\\n                      statusDiagnostico === \'confirmado\'\\n                        ? \'bg-blue-800 text-white border-blue-900 shadow-xs\'\\n                        : \'bg-white text-slate-700 border-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-100\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    <FileCheck2 className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                    <span>Diagn\303\263stico Confirmado (24 no campus)</span>\\n                  </button>\\n\\n                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => setStatusDiagnostico(\'em_investigacao_hipotese\')}\\n                    className={`p-2.5 rounded-lg border text-xs font-semibold text-center transition-all cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 ${\\n                      statusDiagnostico === \'em_investigacao_hipotese\'\\n                        ? \'bg-amber-600 text-white border-amber-700 shadow-xs\'\\n                        : \'bg-white text-amber-900 border-amber-300 hover:bg-amber-50\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    <HelpCircle className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                    <span>Sem Laudo / Em Investiga\303\247\303\243o (5 no campus)</span>\\n                  </button>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {statusDiagnostico === \'em_investigacao_hipotese\' && (\\n                  <div className=\\\"p-2.5 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-lg text-xs text-amber-900 leading-relaxed flex items-start gap-2 mt-2\\\">\\n                    <ShieldCheck className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-700 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\" />\\n                    <span>\\n                      <strong>Garantia Legal Portaria MEC n\302\272 421/2026:</strong> O direito ao PEI e \303\240 Tecnologia Assistiva independe de laudo m\303\251dico pr\303\251vio. A atua\303\247\303\243o docente apoia-se na elimina\303\247\303\243o das barreiras pedag\303\263gicas observadas no laborat\303\263rio de TI.\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n                )}\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* LISTAGEM DAS 9 NEURODIVERG\303\212NCIAS (SOLICITA\303\207\303\203O OFICIAL) */}\\n              <div className=\\\"p-3.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl space-y-2.5\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                  <div>\\n                    <label className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-wider block\\\">\\n                      Neurodiverg\303\252ncias no Contexto de TI & Laborat\303\263rio (DUA 3.0):\\n                    </label>\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-500\\\">\\n                      Selecione uma das 9 neurodiverg\303\252ncias para calibrar barreiras, TA e metas:\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[10px] bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-900 font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono\\\">\\n                    9 Neurodiverg\303\252ncias\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 max-h-56 overflow-y-auto pr-1\\\">\\n                  {[\\n                    {\\n                      id: \'sol-tdah\',\\n                      titulo: \'Transtorno do D\303\251ficit de Aten\303\247\303\243o com Hiperatividade (TDAH)\',\\n                      sigla: \'TDAH\',\\n                      icone: Brain,\\n                      resumo: \'Micro-sprints \303\241geis (Jira/Kanban), Pomodoro, linters no VS Code e TDD em etapas.\',\\n                    },\\n                    {\\n                      id: \'sol-tea\',\\n                      titulo: \'Transtorno do Espectro Autista (TEA)\',\\n                      sigla: \'TEA\',\\n                      icone: Sparkles,\\n                      resumo: \'Previsibilidade, roteiros de testes estruturados, abafador no LABIN e enunciados literais.\',\\n                    },\\n                    {\\n                      id: \'sol-ansiedade\',\\n                      titulo: \'Transtornos de ansiedade (generalizada, f\303\263bico-ansiosos, p\303\242nico, outros)\',\\n                      sigla: \'Ansiedade\',\\n                      icone: HeartPulse,\\n                      resumo: \'Apresenta\303\247\303\243o em v\303\255deo (Loom) ou reservada, rubricas antecipadas, pausas e tempo estendido (+50%).\',\\n                    },\\n                    {\\n                      id: \'sol-aprendizagem\',\\n                      titulo: \'Transtorno espec\303\255fico de aprendizagem (dislexia, disgrafia, discalculia)\',\\n                      sigla: \'Dislexia / Disgrafia\',\\n                      icone: BookOpen,\\n                      resumo: \'Fontes OpenDyslexic, linters visuais de erro e foco na l\303\263gica sem puni\303\247\303\243o sint\303\241tica.\',\\n                    },\\n                    {\\n                      id: \'sol-def-intelectual\',\\n                      titulo: \'Defici\303\252ncia intelectual / Transtorno do desenvolvimento intelectual\',\\n                      sigla: \'Def. Intelectual\',\\n                      icone: Users,\\n                      resumo: \'Instru\303\247\303\265es fracionadas em 2-3 passos, media\303\247\303\243o assistida de monitor e avalia\303\247\303\243o concreta.\',\\n                    },\\n                    {\\n                      id: \'sol-toc\',\\n                      titulo: \'Transtorno obsessivo-compulsivo (TOC)\',\\n                      sigla: \'TOC\',\\n                      icone: CheckSquare,\\n                      resumo: \'Crit\303\251rios expl\303\255citos de aceite (Definition of Done), pipelines CI/CD e limites saud\303\241veis de refatora\303\247\303\243o.\',\\n                    },\\n                    {\\n                      id: \'sol-misto-ansioso-depressivo\',\\n                      titulo: \'Transtorno misto ansioso e depressivo\',\\n                      sigla: \'Misto Ansioso/Depressivo\',\\n                      icone: Activity,\\n                      resumo: \'Metas graduais de recomposi\303\247\303\243o de autoefic\303\241cia, entregas semanais fracionadas e apoio cont\303\255nuo.\',\\n                    },\\n                    {\\n                      id: \'sol-depressao\',\\n                      titulo: \'Transtornos depressivos\',\\n                      sigla: \'Depress\303\243o\',\\n                      icone: Moon,\\n                      resumo: \'Regime de Atividades Acompanhadas (ODP-IFTO), acesso ass\303\255ncrono ao Moodle e duplas acolhedoras.\',\\n                    },\\n                    {\\n                      id: \'sol-epilepsia\',\\n                      titulo: \'Epilepsia e crises convulsivas\',\\n                      sigla: \'Epilepsia\',\\n                      icone: ShieldAlert,\\n                      resumo: \'Monitores com taxa est\303\241vel (60Hz+), tema de IDE sem flashes, pausas a cada 45min e protocolo de seguran\303\247a.\',\\n                    },\\n                  ].map((item) => {\\n                    const isSelected = solucaoId === item.id;\\n                    const IconComponent = item.icone;\\n                    return (\\n                      <button\\n                        key={item.id}\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={() => handleSelectPredefinedSolution(item.id)}\\n                        className={`p-2.5 text-left text-xs rounded-xl border transition-all cursor-pointer relative ${\\n                          isSelected\\n                            ? \'bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-600 text-emerald-950 font-medium shadow-xs ring-1 ring-emerald-600\'\\n                            : \'bg-white border-slate-200 text-slate-700 hover:border-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-50/50\'\\n                        }`}\\n                      >\\n                        <div className=\\\"flex items-start justify-between gap-1.5 mb-1\\\">\\n                          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 min-w-0\\\">\\n                            <div className={`p-1 rounded-md shrink-0 ${isSelected ? \'bg-emerald-700 text-white\' : \'bg-slate-100 text-slate-600\'}`}>\\n                              <IconComponent className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                            </div>\\n                            <span className=\\\"font-bold text-slate-900 truncate text-[11px] leading-tight\\\">\\n                              {item.titulo}\\n                            </span>\\n                          </div>\\n                          {isSelected && (\\n                            <Check className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-700 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\" />\\n                          )}\\n                        </div>\\n                        <p className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 leading-snug line-clamp-2 pl-6\\\">\\n                          {item.resumo}\\n                        </p>\\n                      </button>\\n                    );\\n                  })}\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Secondary toggle for Sensory/Physical conditions */}\\n                <div className=\\\"pt-1 border-t border-slate-200\\\">\\n                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => setMostrarOutrasCondicoes(!mostrarOutrasCondicoes)}\\n                    className=\\\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-emerald-800 hover:text-emerald-950 flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <span>{mostrarOutrasCondicoes ? \'\342\210\222 Ocultar\' : \'+ Exibir\'} Outras Condi\303\247\303\265es (Defici\303\252ncia Visual, Motora, Surdez, Sem Laudo)</span>\\n                  </button>\\n\\n                  {mostrarOutrasCondicoes && (\\n                    <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-1.5 mt-2\\\">\\n                      {bancoDeSolucoesPedagogicas\\n                        .filter(\\n                          (s) =>\\n                            ![\\n                              \'sol-tdah\',\\n                              \'sol-tea\',\\n                              \'sol-ansiedade\',\\n                              \'sol-aprendizagem\',\\n                              \'sol-def-intelectual\',\\n                              \'sol-toc\',\\n                              \'sol-misto-ansioso-depressivo\',\\n                              \'sol-depressao\',\\n                              \'sol-epilepsia\',\\n                            ].includes(s.id)\\n                        )\\n                        .map((sol) => (\\n                          <button\\n                            key={sol.id}\\n                            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                            onClick={() => handleSelectPredefinedSolution(sol.id)}\\n                            className={`p-2 text-left text-xs rounded-lg border transition-all cursor-pointer ${\\n                              solucaoId === sol.id\\n                                ? \'bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-500 text-emerald-950 font-semibold shadow-xs\'\\n                                : \'bg-white border-slate-200 text-slate-700 hover:border-slate-300\'\\n                            }`}\\n                          >\\n                            <span className=\\\"font-bold text-slate-900 truncate block text-[11px]\\\">{sol.titulo}</span>\\n                            <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 block truncate mt-0.5\\\">{sol.condicao}</span>\\n                          </button>\\n                        ))}\\n                    </div>\\n                  )}\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\", \"StartLine\":798, \"TargetContent\":\"              {/* Card B: Componente Curricular de TI */}\\n              <div className=\\\"p-3.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl space-y-3\\\">\\n                <h4 className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                  <Laptop className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-700\\\" />\\n                  <span>Componente Curricular & Curso de TI:</span>\\n                </h4>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"sm:col-span-2\\\">\\n                    <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\\\">\\n                      Curso de TI <span className=\\\"text-red-500\\\">*</span>\\n                    </label>\\n                    <input\\n                      type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                      value={curso}\\n                      onChange={(e) => setCurso(e.target.value)}\\n                      className=\\\"w-full p-2.5 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-600 focus:outline-none bg-white text-xs\\\"\\n                      required\\n                    />\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div>\\n                    <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\\\">\\n                      M\303\263dulo / Per\303\255odo / Ano\\n                    </label>\\n                    <input\\n                      type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                      value={modulo}\\n                      onChange={(e) => setModulo(e.target.value)}\\n                      className=\\\"w-full p-2.5 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-600 focus:outline-none bg-white text-xs\\\"\\n                      required\\n                    />\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div>\\n                  <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\\\">\\n                    Disciplina / Componente Curricular de Computa\303\247\303\243o <span className=\\\"text-red-500\\\">*</span>\\n                  </label>\\n                  <input\\n                    type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                    value={disciplina}\\n                    onChange={(e) => setDisciplina(e.target.value)}\\n                    placeholder=\\\"Ex: Programa\303\247\303\243o Web, Banco de Dados Relacional, Redes, Algoritmos\\\"\\n                    className=\\\"w-full p-2.5 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-600 focus:outline-none bg-white text-xs\\\"\\n                    required\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Card C: Doc\303\252ncia e AEE */}\\n              <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"p-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl\\\">\\n                  <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\\\">\\n                    Docente Regente da Disciplina\\n                  </label>\\n                  <input\\n                    type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                    value={docenteRegente}\\n                    onChange={(e) => setDocenteRegente(e.target.value)}\\n                    className=\\\"w-full p-2.5 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-600 focus:outline-none bg-white text-xs\\\"\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"p-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl\\\">\\n                  <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\\\">\\n                    Coordena\303\247\303\243o NAPNE (Campus Para\303\255so)\\n                  </label>\\n                  <input\\n                    type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                    value={docenteAee}\\n                    disabled\\n                    className=\\\"w-full p-2.5 border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 rounded-lg text-xs\\\"\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n\\n          {/* ============================================================== */}\\n          {/* ETAPA 3: ESTUDO DE CASO, BARREIRAS & DUA 3.0                   */}\\n          {/* ============================================================== */}\\n          {currentStep === 3 && (\\n            <div className=\\\"space-y-4 animate-fadeIn\\\">\\n              {/* Situa\303\247\303\243o Diagn\303\263stica */}\\n              <div className=\\\"p-3.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl space-y-2\\\">\\n                <label className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-wider block\\\">\\n                  Situa\303\247\303\243o Diagn\303\263stica (Portaria MEC n\302\272 421/2026):\\n                </label>\\n                <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\\\">\\n                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => setStatusDiagnostico(\'confirmado\')}\\n                    className={`p-2.5 rounded-lg border text-xs font-semibold text-center transition-all cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 ${\\n                      statusDiagnostico === \'confirmado\'\\n                        ? \'bg-blue-800 text-white border-blue-900 shadow-xs\'\\n                        : \'bg-white text-slate-700 border-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-100\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    <FileCheck2 className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                    <span>Diagn\303\263stico Confirmado (24 no campus)</span>\\n                  </button>\\n\\n                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => setStatusDiagnostico(\'em_investigacao_hipotese\')}\\n                    className={`p-2.5 rounded-lg border text-xs font-semibold text-center transition-all cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 ${\\n                      statusDiagnostico === \'em_investigacao_hipotese\'\\n                        ? \'bg-amber-600 text-white border-amber-700 shadow-xs\'\\n                        : \'bg-white text-amber-900 border-amber-300 hover:bg-amber-50\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    <HelpCircle className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                    <span>Sem Laudo / Em Investiga\303\247\303\243o (5 no campus)</span>\\n                  </button>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {statusDiagnostico === \'em_investigacao_hipotese\' && (\\n                  <div className=\\\"p-2.5 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-lg text-xs text-amber-900 leading-relaxed flex items-start gap-2 mt-2\\\">\\n                    <ShieldCheck className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-700 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\" />\\n                    <span>\\n                      <strong>Garantia Legal Portaria MEC n\302\272 421/2026:</strong> O direito ao PEI e \303\240 Tecnologia Assistiva independe de laudo m\303\251dico pr\303\251vio. A atua\303\247\303\243o docente apoia-se na elimina\303\247\303\243o das barreiras pedag\303\263gicas observadas no laborat\303\263rio de TI.\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n                )}\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Solu\303\247\303\265es do Banco DUA 3.0 Filtradas */}\\n              <div className=\\\"p-3.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl space-y-2\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                  <label className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-wider block\\\">\\n                    Sugest\303\265es R\303\241pidas do Banco DUA 3.0 ({perfilModalidade === \'superior_ti\' ? \'Superior TI\' : \'M\303\251dio T\303\251cnico\'}):\\n                  </label>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono\\\">Clique para aplicar</span>\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-1.5 max-h-36 overflow-y-auto pr-1\\\">\\n                  {filteredSolutions.map((sol) => (\\n                    <button\\n                      key={sol.id}\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      onClick={() => handleSelectPredefinedSolution(sol.id)}\\n                      className={`p-2 text-left text-xs rounded-lg border transition-all cursor-pointer ${\\n                        solucaoId === sol.id\\n                          ? \'bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-500 text-emerald-950 font-semibold shadow-xs\'\\n                          : \'bg-white border-slate-300 text-slate-700 hover:border-slate-400\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                        <span className=\\\"font-bold text-slate-900 truncate\\\">{sol.titulo.split(\'/\')[0]}</span>\\n                        <span className=\\\"text-[9px] text-slate-500 font-mono shrink-0 ml-1\\\">\\n                          {sol.nivelSugerido}\\n                        </span>\\n                      </div>\\n                      <p className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5 truncate\\\">\\n                        {sol.condicao}\\n                      </p>\\n                    </button>\\n                  ))}\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/AddStudentModal.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating Step 2 presets and Step 3 with 9 neurodivergences\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update Step 2 and Step 3 in AddStudentModal.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\355\b\n\352\b\001i\024}\023\341\245\200\235\223\264\254\357Y\037d\233\352J\352\206\v4\032\313\344R~\240~J\305\322\261W\004\243\367\rd\2416]*\001\201U!-\027\347\243:W\273\001If\321+\240\nm:\340j\233xq\353\030\v\330\r\357_\361Xw\313eM\352\262 h\257\ry8\023ZI\231Wk\020\227\016\3421\334\215\220a\342 \025/\341\202\033d\247|\027q\366\251\032\327\253\325L\361\367\n\n\246Gl\370E)1$\250\263\334\374\243\204S\227\235J\002\327\334\357\3236M\223\343h\001\225\337:\363\034\"y,c\022\242\320\t=\352\272\271\237\2540#2\v\271\227\353\320)\217\211\b\337\226K\202\250\353\241\307\331;6\305\314{9\036\031\221yo\200\331\245\306WSml\270H\a\207\350\237\333\214\002\f+I\363\200\336\353\350\374\231\327\377\026\302C\205\347\277\374\354\360m\256Od\322\256\336\304g\247\312\221\224\032\310\332>\t9\2624;hgv\347\213\330\252\340\256r(\325M\273\332\342\"\325v\214\3501r\262\033O\bs\027@\203\n\351\340f\004kL\366\337q\2640\037\002f\367^\331\354\333\000\312%\321K\310\321\023n\360\217\2540\275\340wXufR\f\353W9\313S\006`\221\201\207U\341\341X\273\211H\327s>\371\366\347Uy\2175\2541\351\311\224\270\3547|O\242\005\316\335\212\274\222S\004]\370\224\022\027n\210\317\320\006\245\2158\312Mi\034\220\326\t\275\204\300\332\260cP\225\235\022|e\323\315\006\300\355\\\302!\231\310\204\357+GI\022\323\a)\212,\tr\352\005\334\300\'\367g\210\266W\202y\030\024t\302\200\344]\335\026\260A^\\+\035>\262ST\301T\247\253\2606\317[lS\000\337\3208S\251\250\363\255\341@\351u\fF\343<\020\327xO\3202y;1@!-z\226\307\315\033_\210\3466\266\034\355\221\355\360\020 2\006=\245ROZ\022\267%}\vu\243\005\256\316\253?Fq\3411\234\352\251\325\025\025\234d\207Pv\260&\305r\233=\234\236\244Qc\3512\365dp\250\325H2\311J$0\265\\\237\343\241\325\315D\031\235\2042\246\016\346\250r^\221<\306K\364\245\002{\362\255\350\375\373\310&\3042\320a\017\026.\201\241\201\315\355Q\222\225Y$\274\315\030\356\004\v\001\306\317\254\324Jv\274U\272\002p\020\256\326N\202\376Q\276`\243!ycC\305V\226l\'\265\201\320$@\177]V\324\017G\227\n\203\003\'s\033\0