  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering PEI Deletion**\n\nI\'m now focusing on how users might view and delete a PEI (Plano de Ensino Individualizado). The user wants the ability to delete a PEI if it was saved incorrectly, which is a good point. I\'ll need to include a delete option and add a confirmation prompt like \"Are you sure?\". This addresses an important user need for data management.\n\n\n**Defining Delete Placement**\n\nI\'ve been mapping out where to place the PEI deletion option for maximum user accessibility. I\'m leaning toward integrating it within `ILovePeiHub.tsx`, possibly as a managed list of PEIs, and in the StudentHeader to offer quick deletion. A consistent \"Excluir PEI\" button with a trash icon is key, especially within the PEI viewing components. I\'ve also identified the necessary confirmation prompt: \"Tem Certeza que quer excluir o PEI N#### do Aluno [Nome do Aluno]?\".\n\n\n"
