  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Server Logic**\n\nI\'m currently focused on refactoring `server.ts`. My key goals are to make it accept `selectedNeurodivergences` and `selectedIds` from the request body. From there, I\'ll determine `isAdhd` and `isAutism` flags. I\'ll need to figure out the best way to handle the logic. I am also planning on updating the backend database with the appropriate values.\n\n\n**Expanding Neurodivergence Checks**\n\nI\'m now expanding how neurodivergences are identified. Beyond keywords, I\'m integrating checks from both `selectedIds` and `selectedNeurodivergences`. I\'ll be building cumulative arrays for key strategies and accommodations to ensure comprehensive support for co-occurring conditions like TEA and TDAH. The Gemini prompt will explicitly list all co-occurring conditions, instructing the model to generate tailored accommodations and SMART goals. I\'m also planning to create `ConfirmDeleteModal.tsx`.\n\n\n**Designing Delete Confirmation Modal**\n\nI\'m currently designing the `ConfirmDeleteModal.tsx` component. The modal will have an overlay and card, with an alert icon. The title will be \"Excluir Plano de Ensino (PEI)\". Inside, there will be a confirmation question, a description, and \"Cancelar\" and \"Confirmar\" buttons to guide user interaction. I plan to use props for dynamic content such as `codigoMatricula`, `nomeEstudante`, `disciplina`, and `curso`. I\'ll focus on making it visually clear and user-friendly.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_2479526"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { PEICompleto } from \'../types/pei\';\\nimport { AlertTriangle, Trash2, X, ArrowLeft } from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\ninterface ConfirmDeleteModalProps {\\n  isOpen: boolean;\\n  pei: PEICompleto | null;\\n  onConfirm: () => void;\\n  onCancel: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const ConfirmDeleteModal: React.FC<ConfirmDeleteModalProps> = ({\\n  isOpen,\\n  pei,\\n  onConfirm,\\n  onCancel,\\n}) => {\\n  if (!isOpen || !pei) return null;\\n\\n  const codigo = pei.cabecalho.codigo_matricula || pei.id;\\n  const nome = pei.cabecalho.estudante;\\n  const curso = pei.cabecalho.curso;\\n  const disciplina = pei.cabecalho.componente_curricular;\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div\\n      role=\\\"dialog\\\"\\n      aria-modal=\\\"true\\\"\\n      aria-labelledby=\\\"modal-delete-title\\\"\\n      className=\\\"fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-xs flex items-center justify-center p-4 animate-fadeIn\\\"\\n    >\\n      <div className=\\\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-2xl max-w-lg w-full p-6 sm:p-7 space-y-5 animate-scaleUp relative\\\">\\n        {/* Close button top right */}\\n        <button\\n          onClick={onCancel}\\n          className=\\\"absolute top-4 right-4 p-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n          aria-label=\\\"Fechar\\\"\\n        >\\n          <X className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n        </button>\\n\\n        {/* Warning Icon & Heading */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-start gap-4\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-red-100 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\\\">\\n            <AlertTriangle className=\\\"w-6 h-6\\\" />\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-red-700 bg-red-50 border border-red-200 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md font-mono\\\">\\n              A\303\247\303\243o Irrevers\303\255vel\\n            </span>\\n            <h3 id=\\\"modal-delete-title\\\" className=\\\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900\\\">\\n              Confirmar Exclus\303\243o de PEI\\n            </h3>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Main Confirmation Question as requested */}\\n        <div className=\\\"p-4 bg-red-50/70 border border-red-200 rounded-xl space-y-2\\\">\\n          <p className=\\\"text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-slate-900 leading-snug\\\">\\n            Tem certeza de que deseja excluir o PEI N\302\272 <span className=\\\"font-mono text-red-700 font-bold\\\">{codigo}</span> do estudante <span className=\\\"underline decoration-red-300 font-bold\\\">{nome}</span>?\\n          </p>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n            Caso este plano tenha sido salvo por engano ou com dados incorretos, a exclus\303\243o remover\303\241 todo o planejamento pedag\303\263gico, flexibiliza\303\247\303\265es curriculares (DUA 3.0), metas de aprendizagem e hist\303\263rico do estudo de caso.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Document Details Card */}\\n        <div className=\\\"p-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-xs space-y-1.5 text-slate-600\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"font-medium text-slate-500\\\">Componente Curricular:</span>\\n            <strong className=\\\"text-slate-800 text-right\\\">{disciplina}</strong>\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"font-medium text-slate-500\\\">Curso / Modalidade:</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-slate-700 text-right truncate max-w-[240px]\\\">{curso}</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"font-medium text-slate-500\\\">Docente Regente:</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-slate-700 text-right\\\">{pei.cabecalho.docente_regente}</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Action Buttons */}\\n        <div className=\\\"pt-2 flex flex-col-reverse sm:flex-row items-center justify-end gap-2.5\\\">\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={onCancel}\\n            className=\\\"w-full sm:w-auto px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 text-slate-700 font-semibold text-xs hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5\\\"\\n          >\\n            <ArrowLeft className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n            <span>Cancelar e Manter PEI</span>\\n          </button>\\n\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={onConfirm}\\n            className=\\\"w-full sm:w-auto px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white font-bold text-xs transition-colors shadow-xs flex items-center justify-center gap-2 cursor-pointer focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-500 focus:outline-none\\\"\\n          >\\n            <Trash2 className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n            <span>Sim, Excluir PEI N\302\272 {codigo}</span>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create ConfirmDeleteModal component with explicit confirmation text matching user prompt\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/ConfirmDeleteModal.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating ConfirmDeleteModal.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create ConfirmDeleteModal.tsx\"}"
