  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Frontend Design**\n\nI\'m currently engaged in a comprehensive UX/UI refactoring process, focusing on minimalist and accessible design principles. The goal is a clean interface with low cognitive load, utilizing ample whitespace, effective typography, and optimized component layout. I\'m focusing on `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md` for guidance.\n\n\n"
