  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 5
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Core Request**: Perform a full UX/UI Minimalist and Accessible refactoring (focused on older educators and low cognitive load) combined with deeper practical classroom methodologies, Web Speech API accessibility, and a zero-token Help/Legislation modal (`CentralAjudaModal.tsx`), while preserving `src/types/pei.ts` and `src/data/initialCases.ts`.\n   - **6 Mandatory Deliverables**:\n     1. **Clean up `AddStudentModal.tsx` (Neurodivergence Selection)**:\n        - Remove the long descriptive texts under each neurodivergence in Step 3.\n        - Transform the neurodivergence list into clean, direct **\"Chip / Checkbox\" buttons** showing ONLY the checkbox and condition name (e.g., `[x] TDAH`, `[x] TEA`, `[x] Dislexia / Disgrafia / Discalculia`, etc.).\n        - Keep technical/legal details internal for the AI or hidden behind a discrete toggle button (`\"Ver resumo\"`) that defaults to closed.\n     2. **General Interface Decluttering (`App.tsx`, `Navbar.tsx`, `StudentHeader.tsx`, `ILovePeiHub.tsx`, `PeiView.tsx`, `CaseStudyView.tsx`)**:\n        - **Compact Headers**: Streamline `StudentHeader.tsx` into a single, clean, compact bar without redundant buttons; eliminate duplicate header/breadcrumb bars in `App.tsx` so main content appears near the top of the screen.\n        - **Remove Legal/Acronym Clutter**: Remove repetitive \"Art. 11\", \"Decreto 12.686/2025\", \"Portaria MEC 421/2026\", \"Caderno 3/4\" banners and long helper paragraphs from daily navigation views. Keep formal legal citations strictly in the footer, `CentralAjudaModal.tsx`, and `OfficialTemplateView.tsx`.\n        - **Clean `PeiView.tsx`**: Increase whitespace, remove conflicting multi-colored borders/boxes, and organize PEI sections into clean, direct blocks.\n        - **Simple Navigation Labels**: Use direct names with icons accompanied by clear text: `\"In\303\255cio\"`, `\"Plano de Aula (PEI)\"`, `\"Estudo de Caso\"`, `\"Metas e Notas\"`, `\"Imprimir p/ SEI\"`.\n     3. **Elaborated & Practical Teaching Methodologies (AI / `server.ts` & `SolutionBankModal.tsx`)**:\n        - Deliver a structured **Guia Pr\303\241tico de Sala de Aula** for each neurodivergence/PEI containing:\n          1. **Passo a Passo na Pr\303\241tica**: How to explain the specific subject content tangibly for the student\'s profile.\n          2. **Divis\303\243o da Tarefa (Chunking)**: How to break large activities into 3 smaller steps.\n          3. **Como Avaliar na Pr\303\241tica**: Concrete adapted test/assignment format and fair grading criteria.\n          4. **Manejo e Acolhimento**: What to do if the student freezes or becomes dysregulated.\n     4. **Student View (`PeiView.tsx`)**:\n        - Add a clean **\"Ver Guia do Aluno\"** button in `PeiView.tsx` that displays a simplified, welcoming summary aimed at the student to read or listen to their goals as a checklist and practical study tips based on their interests (`potencialidades`).\n     5. **Free Practical Accessibility (Native Web Speech API in `pt-BR`)**:\n        - Add a **\"Ditar por Voz\"** button (`webkitSpeechRecognition` / `SpeechRecognition` in `pt-BR`) on teacher observation/barrier fields (`PeiPainelView.tsx`, `AddStudentModal.tsx`, and `PeiView.tsx`).\n        - Add an **\"Ouvir\"** button (`window.speechSynthesis` in `pt-BR`) to read PEI strategies and Student Guide aloud (`PeiView.tsx` and `SolutionBankModal.tsx`).\n     6. **Help & Legislation Center (`CentralAjudaModal.tsx` - Zero Token Cost)**:\n        - Create `src/components/CentralAjudaModal.tsx` accessible via a discrete floating button in the footer (**\"Ajuda & Legisla\303\247\303\243o\"**), containing:\n          - **Checklist R\303\241pido do Professor**: 3 practical steps based on PNEEI/MEC pedagogical guidelines.\n          - **Gloss\303\241rio do NAPNE**: Short definitions of common terms (PAEE, DUA, PNEEI, PEI, AEE, TA).\n          - **Links Oficiais Institucionais**: Safe shortcuts to consult **Portaria MEC n\302\272 421/2026** and **Decreto n\302\272 12.686/2025** in the DOU.\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Completed Previously & Verified**:\n     - Multi-selection of neurodivergences (e.g., TEA + TDAH) and `ConfirmDeleteModal.tsx` (`\"Tem certeza de que deseja excluir o PEI N\302\272 [c\303\263digo] do estudante [nome]?\"`) were implemented and verified via `compile_applet` and `lint_applet`.\n   - **Completed in Current Turn**:\n     - Read `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md`, `src/components/Navbar.tsx`, `src/components/PeiView.tsx`, `src/components/PeiPainelView.tsx`, `src/components/SolutionBankModal.tsx`, and `src/components/CaseStudyView.tsx`.\n     - Updated `src/types/pei.ts`: Added `GuiaPraticoSalaAula` interface (`passo_a_passo_explicacao`, `divisao_tarefa_chunking`, `avaliacao_pratica`, `manejo_e_acolhimento`) and optional fields `guia_pratico_sala_de_aula?: GuiaPraticoSalaAula` on `PlanejamentoPEI` and `guiaPratico?: GuiaPraticoSalaAula` on `SolucaoCondicao`.\n     - Updated `src/data/initialCases.ts`: Populated `guiaPratico` for all 13 neurodivergences/conditions in `bancoDeSolucoesPedagogicas` and updated `gerarNovoPeiCompleto` to synthesize `guia_pratico_sala_de_aula`.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - `frontend-design` skill rules emphasize whitespace over nested colored cards, avoiding thick left borders (`border-l-4`), avoiding decorative status dots, and keeping navigation and metadata clean and unboxed.\n   - Web Speech API in browsers uses `window.SpeechRecognition || (window as any).webkitSpeechRecognition` with `lang = \'pt-BR\'` for speech-to-text, and `window.speechSynthesis` with `SpeechSynthesisUtterance` (`lang = \'pt-BR\'`) for text-to-speech. Creating a small helper or reusable buttons (`VoiceDictationButton` and `ListenAloudButton`) in `src/utils/speech.ts` or `src/components/SpeechControls.tsx` will make integrating voice dictation and audio playback across `AddStudentModal.tsx`, `PeiPainelView.tsx`, `PeiView.tsx`, and `SolutionBankModal.tsx` super clean and reliable.\n\n4. **Errors & Fixes**\n   - Earlier duplicate `bancoDeSolucoesPedagogicas` declaration in `src/data/initialCases.ts` was fixed and verified.\n   - Earlier Gemini 429 quota warning on stderr was fixed in `server.ts` with a 5-minute cooldown and stdout logging.\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - Dev server is running on port 3000 (`tsx server.ts`).\n   - `src/types/pei.ts` and `src/data/initialCases.ts` are already updated with `GuiaPraticoSalaAula`.\n\n6. **Next Steps (In Priority Order)**\n   - **Step 1: Create Speech Controls (`src/components/SpeechControls.tsx`)**\n     - Implement reusable `<VoiceDictationButton onTranscript={(text) => ...} />` (using `SpeechRecognition` / `webkitSpeechRecognition` in `pt-BR`) and `<ListenButton text=\"...\" label=\"Ouvir\" />` (using `window.speechSynthesis` in `pt-BR` with play/stop toggle).\n   - **Step 2: Create `src/components/CentralAjudaModal.tsx`**\n     - Implement the lightweight, zero-token modal with:\n       1. **Checklist R\303\241pido do Professor** (3 practical steps based on PNEEI/MEC notebooks).\n       2. **Gloss\303\241rio do NAPNE** (PAEE, DUA, PNEEI, PEI, AEE, TA).\n       3. **Links Oficiais Institucionais** (Portaria MEC n\302\272 421/2026 and Decreto n\302\272 12.686/2025 on DOU/Gov.br).\n   - **Step 3: Refactor `src/components/AddStudentModal.tsx` (Deliverables 1 & 5)**\n     - In Step 3 of the wizard, replace the verbose neurodivergence cards with clean **\"Chip / Checkbox\" buttons** showing ONLY the checkbox and condition name (e.g., `[x] TDAH`, `[x] TEA`, `[x] Ansiedade`, `[x] Dislexia / Disgrafia / Discalculia`, etc.).\n     - Put the condition summary inside a discrete collapsible toggle (`\"Ver resumo\"`) that is **closed by default**.\n     - Remove excessive legal/explanatory text blocks in the modal.\n     - Add `<VoiceDictationButton />` next to the \"Barreiras Observadas\" and \"Potencialidades\" textareas so teachers can dictate by voice.\n     - Ensure `guia_pratico_sala_de_aula` from backend/local generator is mapped into `finalPei.planejamento_pei`.\n   - **Step 4: Update `server.ts` & `src/components/SolutionBankModal.tsx` (Deliverable 3)**\n     - Update `synthesizeIodaPei` and the Gemini prompt in `server.ts` to include `guia_pratico_sala_de_aula` (`passo_a_passo_explicacao`, `divisao_tarefa_chunking`, `avaliacao_pratica`, `manejo_e_acolhimento`).\n     - Update `SolutionBankModal.tsx` to display the 4-part **Guia Pr\303\241tico de Sala de Aula** cleanly, add a `<ListenButton />` to read the guide aloud, and pass `guiaPratico` when applying a solution to the active PEI.\n   - **Step 5: Refactor `src/components/PeiView.tsx` (Deliverables 2, 3, 4, 5)**\n     - Declutter UI: remove the dark legal banner at the top and repetitive legal citations; increase whitespace (`space-y-8`, `p-6`), use clean neutral cards (`bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl`) instead of conflicting amber/teal/purple boxes.\n     - Add top action bar with **\"Ver Guia do Aluno\"** toggle button (Deliverable 4) and **\"Ouvir Estrat\303\251gias\"** button (`<ListenButton />`, Deliverable 5).\n     - When **\"Ver Guia do Aluno\"** is active, display a welcoming, student-facing view with an interactive checklist of their goals (`objetivos_e_metas`), study tips tailored to their `potencialidades` and `recursos_ta`, and an **\"Ouvir Meu Guia\"** button.\n     - In the teacher view of `PeiView.tsx`, display the 4-part **Guia Pr\303\241tico de Sala de Aula** (Passo a Passo na Pr\303\241tica, Divis\303\243o da Tarefa em 3 etapas, Como Avaliar na Pr\303\241tica, Manejo e Acolhimento) and add a `<VoiceDictationButton />` for editing/dictating teacher observations (`observacoes_docente`).\n   - **Step 6: Declutter `Navbar.tsx`, `StudentHeader.tsx`, `ILovePeiHub.tsx`, `CaseStudyView.tsx`, `PeiPainelView.tsx`, and `App.tsx` (Deliverables 2, 5, 6)**\n     - `Navbar.tsx`: Use exact simple labels with icons + text: `\"In\303\255cio\"` (`hub`), `\"Plano de Aula (PEI)\"` (`pei`), `\"Estudo de Caso\"` (`estudo_caso`), `\"Metas e Notas\"` (`painel`), `\"Imprimir p/ SEI\"` (`documento_oficial`).\n     - `StudentHeader.tsx` & `App.tsx`: Eliminate the duplicate breadcrumb bar in `App.tsx` and compact `StudentHeader.tsx` into a single clean, elegant bar at the top of the screen without repetitive census/legal paragraphs.\n     - `ILovePeiHub.tsx` & `CaseStudyView.tsx`: Strip out repetitive \"Art. 11\", \"Decreto 12.686/2025\", \"Portaria MEC 421/2026\" badges and verbose helper text.\n     - `PeiPainelView.tsx`: Clean up header, remove \"Caderno 3\" legal clutter, and add `<VoiceDictationButton />` to the observation textarea in the \"Adicionar Nota\" modal.\n     - `App.tsx`: Add the discrete floating button **\"Ajuda & Legisla\303\247\303\243o\"** in the footer/corner that opens `CentralAjudaModal.tsx`, and support updating `observacoes_docente` and `guia_pratico_sala_de_aula`.\n   - **Step 7: Verification**\n     - Run `compile_applet`, `lint_applet`, and `restart_dev_server` to ensure zero TypeScript or build errors.\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Keep student names hidden on the home Hub (`ILovePeiHub.tsx`) and visible only after opening a specific PEI.\n   - Maintain `src/types/pei.ts` compatibility and `src/data/initialCases.ts` data.\n   - Avoid `window.alert` / `window.open` (for external DOU links, use `<a href=\"...\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">`).\n</summary>"
