  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Generating IODA\'s Avatar**\n\nI\'m making progress. I can now generate a high-fidelity replica of the IODA robot mascot from the embedded image. My next step is to place the generated image in the `/public/assets/ioda-avatar.png` directory. It\'s almost complete!\n\n\n**Detailing IODA\'s Appearance**\n\nI\'ve examined the image and cataloged the IODA robot\'s features meticulously. The `generate_image` function will incorporate details like the \"IODA\" chest print, Yoda-like ears with orange trim, green eyes, orange accents on the white body, and the holographic icons. I am ready to render the image now. Then, I will move the final IODA avatar image file to the intended path. Concurrently, the code in `Navbar.tsx`, `ILovePeiHub.tsx`, `Official` files will be amended.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_495114"
      name: "generate_image"
      arguments_json: "{\"AspectRatio\":\"16:9\", \"ImageName\":\"ioda_avatar\", \"Prompt\":\"A cute 3D Pixar-style friendly robot mascot named IODA standing center frame on a smooth dark slate-gray studio background. The robot has a rounded matte off-white head and body with bright orange accent trim on the collar, torso, shoulders, wrists, and ankles. It has large Yoda-like pointed robotic ears with orange inner rings, and two large round expressive eyes with glowing emerald-green irises and dark pupils. Across the center of its chest is the word \'IODA\' in clean dark gray sans-serif capital letters. Floating around the robot are glowing translucent green and cyan holographic accessibility and technology icons: on the left side, glowing green wheelchair accessibility symbols, an ear icon, a speaker icon, and audio waveforms; on the right side, glowing cyan and green gear icons, a binary code hologram card, and a digital interface panel. Soft studio lighting, octane render, 8k, high detail.\", \"toolAction\":\"Generating IODA robot mascot image\", \"toolSummary\":\"Generate IODA mascot image\"}"
