  generate_image {
    prompt: "A cute 3D Pixar-style friendly robot mascot named IODA standing center frame on a smooth dark slate-gray studio background. The robot has a rounded matte off-white head and body with bright orange accent trim on the collar, torso, shoulders, wrists, and ankles. It has large Yoda-like pointed robotic ears with orange inner rings, and two large round expressive eyes with glowing emerald-green irises and dark pupils. Across the center of its chest is the word \'IODA\' in clean dark gray sans-serif capital letters. Floating around the robot are glowing translucent green and cyan holographic accessibility and technology icons: on the left side, glowing green wheelchair accessibility symbols, an ear icon, a speaker icon, and audio waveforms; on the right side, glowing cyan and green gear icons, a binary code hologram card, and a digital interface panel. Soft studio lighting, octane render, 8k, high detail."
