    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Goal 1 (Speech API Removal)**: Completely remove all browser Speech Recognition (`SpeechRecognition`) and Text-to-Speech (`speechSynthesis`) buttons and logic (\"Ditar por Voz\" and \"Ouvir em Voz Alta\") across the app so text fields use clean, stable traditional typing.\n   - **Goal 2 (Official IFTO/NAPNE PDF Template)**: Align `/src/components/OfficialTemplateView.tsx` strictly with the official IFTO / NAPNE (Campus Para\303\255so do Tocantins) institutional template (`Template_pei_e7835c6d.docx__Converted_-_2026-10-27_09_07_`), including the IFTO/NAPNE header, clean tables with light gray headers (`bg-slate-200`) and thin black borders (`border-black`) for all 8 required sections, side-by-side signature lines (\"Docente\" and \"Coordenadora NAPNE\"), and `@media print` CSS rules (`no-print`).\n   - **Goal 3 (Mascot Removal)**: The user asked to remove the IODA mascot (`\"remova o mascote, a adapta\303\247ao nao ficou legal\"`), restoring clean institutional headers without any mascot image.\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Completed**:\n     - Deleted `/src/components/SpeechControls.tsx`.\n     - Removed all `VoiceDictationButton` and `ListenButton` imports and usages from:\n       - `/src/components/AddStudentModal.tsx`\n       - `/src/components/PeiView.tsx`\n       - `/src/components/PeiPainelView.tsx`\n       - `/src/components/SolutionBankModal.tsx`\n     - Rewrote `/src/components/OfficialTemplateView.tsx` with the official IFTO (Campus Para\303\255so do Tocantins) + NAPNE institutional table header, student photo/ID box, all 8 bordered table sections with `bg-slate-200` headers, and side-by-side signature blocks for \"Docente\" and \"Coordenadora NAPNE\".\n     - Updated `/src/index.css` with `@media print` rules (`@page { size: A4 portrait; margin: 12mm; }`, `-webkit-print-color-adjust: exact`, `.no-print`, `.official-print-sheet`).\n     - Updated `handlePrint` in `/src/App.tsx` to switch `activeTab` to `\'documento_oficial\'` before calling `window.print()`.\n     - Removed all `<img src=\"/assets/ioda-avatar.png\" ... />` references from `/src/components/Navbar.tsx`, `/src/components/ILovePeiHub.tsx`, and `/src/components/OfficialTemplateView.tsx`, restoring clean institutional badges and headers.\n   - **Remaining**:\n     - Delete the binary file `public/assets/ioda-avatar.png` via `run_command` (`rm -f public/assets/ioda-avatar.png`) and run `compile_applet` to confirm the final build succeeds.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - Read `/public/assets/aistudio/Template_pei_e7835c6d.docx__Converted_-_2026-10-27_09_07_` which provided the exact wording and structure of the 8 official IFTO/NAPNE PEI sections and the \"Docente\" + \"Coordenadora NAPNE\" signature footer.\n\n4. **Errors & Fixes**\n   - `generate_image` failed with `generic::resource_exhausted: You exceeded your current quota`. Worked around initially by generating a programmatic PNG, which the user subsequently asked to remove (`\"remova o mascote, a adapta\303\247ao nao ficou legal\"`).\n   - `delete_file` on `/public/assets/ioda-avatar.png` returned `while decoding file, failed to detect charset with sufficient confidence` because `delete_file` attempts charset detection on binary PNG files. Use `run_command` with `rm -f public/assets/ioda-avatar.png` to delete binary files if needed.\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - All React/TypeScript source files (`/src/components/Navbar.tsx`, `/src/components/ILovePeiHub.tsx`, `/src/components/OfficialTemplateView.tsx`, `/src/components/AddStudentModal.tsx`, `/src/components/PeiView.tsx`, `/src/components/PeiPainelView.tsx`, `/src/components/SolutionBankModal.tsx`, `/src/App.tsx`, `/src/index.css`) have already been updated to their final state with no mascot references and no Speech API references.\n\n6. **Next Steps**\n   1. Run `run_command` with `rm -f public/assets/ioda-avatar.png` (Cwd: `/app/applet`) to remove the unused binary image file.\n   2. Run `compile_applet` to verify the TypeScript and Vite build succeeds after removing the mascot references from `Navbar.tsx`, `ILovePeiHub.tsx`, and `OfficialTemplateView.tsx`.\n   3. Respond concisely in Portuguese confirming that the mascot has been removed from all screens and the institutional layout is clean.\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Communicate in Portuguese (pt-BR).\n   - Keep UI clean and institutional (IFTO / NAPNE Campus Para\303\255so do Tocantins), with no mascot images and no voice recognition/synthesis buttons.\n</summary>"
